 a stubbed `callisto` shell function for exit codes 1, 2, 0, and 127, then checks step exit code and the HAS_CHANGESETS value observed.\n\nFollow the plan's RED step first: create the test script exactly as specified, run it against the CURRENT (buggy) action.yml, confirm it fails exactly as predicted (AC-01 and AC-04's exit-0 case fail, AC-02 and AC-04's exit-127 case pass — since exit 127 already happens to fall into the current unconditional else-branch's `exit $STATUS_EXIT`, which is non-zero for 127). Then apply the plan's exact action.yml edit, confirm all 4 cases pass. Commit with the plan's exact commit message when green.\n\nSince this task has no cargo compile step, standard `just ci`-style checks don't fully apply — but do run `cargo fmt --check` and confirm no Rust files were touched unexpectedly (this task should ONLY touch action.yml and the new test script). Single, self-contained task — do not start T2 or any other task."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1673,"cache_read_input_tokens":444977,"output_tokens":1854,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":672},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1673,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1854,"cache_read_input_tokens":444977,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1673},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeChMMD5xNomcv4cwyd9c","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ffb868d-434d-4678-ae68-f7ec0ff005ed","timestamp":"2026-08-19T19:56:57.800Z","effort":"high","session_id":"bb531e8d-c394-4e47-a8ae-e4a9ceeca6d2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061