0` (consumption/exit code)\n- `crates/callisto-moon/src/extension.rs:203` (consumption/exit code)\n- `crates/callisto-graph/tests/validate_command_tests.rs:203` (pre-existing test, updated to compile/pass)\n\n**Verification**: `cargo test -p callisto-model` (92 passed), `cargo test -p callisto-graph` (all passed), `cargo test -p callisto-cli` (all passed, e2e output confirmed `{\"schemaVersion\":1,\"ok\":true,\"diagnostics\":[]}`), `cargo fmt --check` clean on all four touched crates, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n**Commit**: `c277c561` — `fix(model): align ValidateReport wire shape with docs/01-spec.md M.12.6`\n\nNo schema_version bump, per the resolved constraint. No contradiction found — doc and intended code agreed; only the code was out of sync.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>77048</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>50</tool_uses><duration_ms>1076667</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"0f8fa660-c48c-4bdd-b869-7c778b8b61c7","timestamp":"2026-08-20T17:24:08.248Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
