{"parentUuid":"c61db0f2-3176-4a6c-a811-9a6e1dd08872","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeEVph4JDESLGnbXCJfhU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011VSn4QkfiCHUQ4UzyAVy6k","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngit add crates/callisto-cli/src/render/mod.rs crates/callisto-cli/tests/schema_guard_test.rs crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/tag.rs crates/callisto-graph/tests/tag_sha_fabrication_test.rs crates/callisto-graph/tests/tags_tests.rs crates/callisto-model/src/report.rs\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(model): align TagReport/CreatedTag wire shape with docs/01-spec.md M.12.6\n\nRenames TagReport.created_tags to tags (JSON key \"tags\", not\n\"createdTags\") and adds CreatedTag.already_existed: bool -- true when\nthe tag already existed at this sha and was left alone, making Track\n4's idempotence fix (commits 5166d601/3bcc91e2) observable on the wire\nrather than only inferable from unchanged state.\n\nAll four CreatedTag construction sites in create_tags_with_options\n(the per-release tag and the floating-major alias, in both apply and\n--dry-run mode) already computed an `already_existed`/`major_already_existed`\nlocal via contains_tag() for their own sha-resolution logic -- this\njust threads that existing value into the struct instead of computing\nit a second time.\n\nUpdates Track 4's AC-13 schema guard baseline (crates/callisto-cli/\ntests/schema_guard_test.rs) to reflect this intentional shape change --\nthat guard's purpose is catching drift, and this is the task whose\nexplicit scope is changing CreatedTag's shape.\n\nThis closes out Track 6-mechanical's report-field-shape work: all four\nJSON report types with confirmed mismatches (StatusReport, ValidateReport,\nComposePrBodyReport, TagReport/CreatedTag) are now aligned with\ndocs/01-spec.md. No SCHEMA_VERSION bump (no external registry consumer\nyet).\nEOF\n)\"\ngit log --oneline -6","description":"Commit final Track 6-mechanical fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_read_input_tokens":651342,"output_tokens":757,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":651342,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeEVpdiddy53B4F5mNCty","type":"assistant","uuid":"44703c31-b0be-4b79-b46d-663bde2fb9fa","timestamp":"2026-08-20T18:46:47.394Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
