007's phrase \"per-package rendering path directly\" was ambiguous (could imply a new internal function). Fixed: clarified as calling the existing public render_pr_body_from_plan function, no new function introduced; also added to non_goals.\n5+6. AC-003 and AC-004 left the synthesized ChangelogEntry's required `severity` field completely unconstrained/untested. Fixed: both now require severity to equal the package's resolved bump severity (outcome.severities.get(id)), with test methods updated to assert it.\n\nVerify all six fixes hold against live code, and do a genuinely fresh full pass over every other acceptance criterion (AC-001 through AC-007) checking for anything else missed. Specifically re-verify: pr_body.rs's actual match arms and line numbers (both the Executive Summary table ~99-124 and the collapsible-details block ~178-216) to confirm the new grep target strings are accurate and won't collide with anything unintended; ChangelogEntry's actual field requirements (severity + source, both required) in crates/callisto-changelog/src/input.rs; BumpReason's full variant list in crates/callisto-model/src/report.rs to confirm Inference/PreRelease/NewGroupMember are indeed the only three variants missing from pr_body.rs's existing match.\n\nIf this passes, it moves to vector:planner next."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":234,"cache_read_input_tokens":702702,"output_tokens":1178,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":234,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1178,"cache_read_input_tokens":702702,"cache_creation_input_tokens":234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":234},"type":"message"}],"s