eated_tags→tags`) and new mandatory fields, `registry.rs`'s redaction helpers, `exec.rs`'s `run_quiet` default method, and `cascade.rs`'s `cascade_action` `source`-gated peer escalation) had every caller updated consistently, including the GitHub Action script (`action.yml`) which reads exit codes rather than the renamed JSON keys, so no cross-language break there either.\n\nNo files were modified — this was a read-only investigation.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>210543</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>83</tool_uses><duration_ms>904293</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
