{"parentUuid":"1ce419b7-97ff-48a5-b745-a6eba74cb966","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeG38zio5cBKcdbbg7arj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Full picture, confirmed:\n\n- **Auto-merge is disabled repo-wide** (`allow_auto_merge: false`) — nobody, including any bot or workflow, can set a PR to merge automatically once checks pass. Every merge requires someone to actively click the button.\n- **No required reviews, no required status checks** configured on `main` — meaning the merge button isn't gated by anyone else's approval either way (there's no \"2 approvals required\" rule some other collaborator could satisfy).\n- **PR #5 has no pending auto-merge request** — it's just sitting there, mergeable, waiting for a manual click.\n- All of this is moot anyway since only you (`castrog`) can push to `main`, and the merge button itself performs that push — GitHub blocks the merge action entirely for anyone without push rights on the base branch.\n\nSo: nobody but you can hit merge, nothing can merge itself automatically, and no one else's review could unlock it even if they tried. You're the only path to merge."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1032,"cache_read_input_tokens":484500,"output_tokens":323,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1032,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":484500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1032,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1032},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeG38twHKTfwWTyhavwCr","type":"assistant","uuid":"6be3923c-f012-4ef4-9c4b-70be2061ba26