{"parentUuid":"3bb081c1-bab6-4f55-be88-7ff1b2edd5d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGBBvvrpRASx1o5THq4Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NdXCbW9R8NqPnJ9GUxMoQh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add crates/callisto-vcs/src/shell.rs && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(vcs): tolerate a missing .git repository in list_tags, not just missing failures\n\nThe earlier fix (surface git tag --list failures instead of silently\ntreating them as zero tags) was too broad: it also turned a directory\nwith no .git anywhere in its ancestry into a hard error, breaking an\nexisting, deliberate contract (a brand-new/pre-git package reports \"no\ntags\" rather than aborting -- see callisto-moon's\nexecute_extension_no_git_repo_succeeds_with_no_last_tag_not_panic).\nlist_tags now distinguishes \"not a git repository\" (tolerated as\nOk(vec![])) from any other failure (still a real Err).\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_read_input_tokens":635679,"output_tokens":332,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":332,"cache_read_input_tokens":635679,"cache_creation_input_tokens":483,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":483},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGBBqL1MADkKYfD68ti4","type":"assistant","uuid":"e101508d-64a6-4a98-b632-57c6802a3b36","timestamp":"2026-08-21T16:03:32.784Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto",