{"parentUuid":"60258567-cbb4-42a8-b8cb-4dea042fa776","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGBxBrGNYuvWaVj1dh8N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 7 CI checks are green on PR #5. All 8 code-review findings are resolved:\n\n- **4 real fixes landed**: symlink discovery, `validate()`/`aggregate()` ambiguity mismatch, `list_tags` swallowing failures (twice — first pass broke a deliberate \"no `.git` repo\" contract, caught by CI and fixed properly), `IdentityIndex.platform` rekeying, Python workspace-membership filter, unbounded `pending_line`.\n- **1 false positive investigated and correctly skipped**: the tag dry-run sha \"bug\" — floating tags are supposed to force-move, so the original code was already correct.\n- **1 deferred**: the redundant-persist finding — a proper fix needs a `Manifest` trait signature change; the quick fix I tried conflicted with an existing deliberate test, so I backed it out rather than ship something risky.\n\nPR #5 is ready: https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/5"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":958,"cache_read_input_tokens":643277,"output_tokens":327,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":958,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":643277,"cache_creation_input_tokens":958,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":958},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGBx9MwqTtqqW1yuSPwo","type":"assistant","uuid":"15462390-46d9-45b2-9c2b-a55370a46fa5","timestamp":"2026-08-21T16:13:33.881Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType