{"parentUuid":"1848ccdd-417a-4d22-b09d-068ec1ee4e89","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGEHrNXhqvbDqD6c3H2P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1105,"cache_read_input_tokens":647859,"output_tokens":1767,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1066},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1105,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1767,"cache_read_input_tokens":647859,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1105,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1105},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGEHmsugqgcqKifcCqfZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"1f639353-9b79-44d4-907b-212497f3d87d","timestamp":"2026-08-21T16:44:23.952Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"1f639353-9b79-44d4-907b-212497f3d87d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGEHrNXhqvbDqD6c3H2P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two separate answers:\n\n**\"Shouldn't the versions be lined up?\"** — They already are. Every crate uses `version.workspace = true` pointing at one shared `0.3.3` in the root `Cargo.toml`, confirmed in source and `Cargo.lock` alike. (The stray \"v0.3.2\" you may have seen in an earlier lint log tail was just a stale target-dir cache artifact, not a real mismatch.)\n\n**\"Should this be v1?\"** — I checked `callisto-format/src/bump.rs`: its bump logic does a *literal* major bump (`major+1, 0, 0`) with no pre-1.0 dampening (unlike npm/changesets, which by default treats a \"major\" severity pre-1.0 as a minor bump instead). Since the changeset I wrote genuinely assigns `major` severity to 5 packages — not inflated, real breaking changes (new required `CascadeInput` fields, `Manifest::persist` now required, JSON field renames, etc.) — running `callisto version` as-is would produce **v1.0.0** for the whole workspace, since it's one shared version number.\n\nWhether that's the right call is a real product decision, not a technical one:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1105,"cache_read_input_tokens":647859,"output_tokens":1767,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1066},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1105,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1767,"cache_read_input_tokens":647859,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1105,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1105},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGEHmsugqgcqKifcCqfZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"da1da8b1-a615-4b1f-b751-e54b9e402c60","timestamp":"2026-08-21T16:44:27.570Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"da1da8b1-a615-4b1f-b751-e54b9e402c60","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGEHrNXhqvbDqD6c3H2P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BQUR6zHpbsNdixQDXnuHZS","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"This release genuinely has breaking changes (real major severity), so the changeset as written will produce v1.0.0. How do you want to handle it?","header":"Version target","options":[{"label":"Ship as v1.0.0","description":"Let the changeset's real severity stand. This is the first real tagged release with a stable-API declaration — appropriate given the breaking changes are genuine, not inflated."},{"label":"Cap it at a minor bump for now (e.g. v0.4.0)","description":"Downgrade the changeset's severities to minor, treat this as one more pre-1.0 iteration, and defer the v1.0 declaration until there's been some real usage to validate the new surface (matches your 'worthy of v1' instinct)."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1105,"cache_read_input_tokens":647859,"output_tokens":1767,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1066},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1105,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1767,"cache_read_input_tokens":647859,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1105,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1105},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGEHmsugqgcqKifcCqfZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"2fa2e719-e452-47c4-8ed4-b1a67284698d","timestamp":"2026-08-21T16:44:30.640Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","c