{"parentUuid":"dcdfeacb-0c32-4910-b8f6-b935bddd272a","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"PR #5 has all review fixes, is fully green, and awaits your merge decision. I just found the shared workspace-version write logic can silently corrupt version numbers when packages have different bump severities — need your go-ahead to fix the changeset and that bug before merging.","timestamp":"2026-08-21T17:14:22.519Z","uuid":"11e0b02d-974a-41b4-9298-127ea787ae0c","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
