{"parentUuid":"54c5cb23-ef29-40b9-9267-d15cbad13ab5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGJAzrnH8ToPEqGbhogR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let me check Knope's actual \"Packages\" doc directly — that's likely where cross-package workspace grouping is defined."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1742,"cache_read_input_tokens":696845,"output_tokens":394,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":204},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":394,"cache_read_input_tokens":696845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1742,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1742},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGJAvGCvhXjvgfW6wkbr","type":"assistant","uuid":"7ebcb1d6-1e47-4984-9405-a40e36765774","timestamp":"2026-08-21T17:35:08.093Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"7ebcb1d6-1e47-4984-9405-a40e36765774","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGJAzrnH8ToPEqGbhogR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Gdzvof6Zqz6Bn79aMH4kNK","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://knope.tech/reference/concepts/package/","prompt":"Does Knope support grouping multiple packages (e.g. in a Cargo workspace) so they all bump to the same version together, taking the highest/max severity across all packages in the group? How is this configured?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1742,"cache_read_input_tokens":696845,"output_tokens":394,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":204},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":394,"cache_read_input_tokens":696845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1742,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1742},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGJAvGCvhXjvgfW6wkbr","type":"assistant","uuid":"089adfd5-7e14-4f8b-a1d3-9f12c12a9a7e","timestamp":"2026-08-21T17:35:08.915Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"089adfd5-7e14-4f8b-a1d3-9f12c12a9a7e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a254f192-f991-43d4-85e4-802bb6fad84e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gdzvof6Zqz6Bn79aMH4kNK","type":"tool_result","content":"# Knope Package Grouping Support\n\nBased on the provided documentation, there is **no information** indicating that Knope supports grouping multiple packages to bump versions together or applying the highest severity across a package group.\n\nThe documentation explains that Knope treats each package independently: \"To split out some of Knope's functionality into a Rust crate that others could consume, say `knope-changelogs`, _that_ crate would be a _separate_ package with its own version number.\"\n\nThe only relevant guidance is the decision criterion: \"ask yourself whether _every_ change that affects one always affects both\" to determine if files should belong to one package or separate packages. However, this is about organization, not automated synchronized versioning across multiple packages.\n\nTo get a definitive answer about this feature request, you would need to:\n- Check the full [Packages configuration reference](/reference/config-file/packages/)\n- Consult the project's GitHub issues or Discord community\n- Review the complete default configuration documentation"}]},"uuid":"5350cfdb-64b5-4ef0-9bcb-b7198aec507b","timestamp":"2026-08-21T17:35:14.346Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":48776,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Knope Package Grouping Support\n\nBased on the provided documentation, there is **no information** indicating that Knope supports grouping multiple packages to bump versions together or applying the highest severity across a package group.\n\nThe documentation explains that Knope treats each package independently: \"To split out some of Knope's functionality into a Rust crate that others could consume, say `knope-changelogs`, _that_ crate would be a _separate_ package with its own version number.\"\n\nThe only relevant guidance is the decision criterion: \"ask yourself whether _every_ change that affects one always affects both\" to determine if files should belong to one package or separate packages. However, this is about organization, not automated synchronized versioning across multiple packages.\n\nTo get a definitive answer about this feature request, you would need to:\n- Check the full [Packages configuration reference](/reference/config-file/packages/)\n- Consult the project's GitHub issues or Discord community\n- Review the complete default configuration documentation","durationMs":3714,"url":"https://knope.tech/reference/concepts/package/"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"089adfd5-7e14-4f8b-a1d3-9f12c12a9a7e","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
