{"parentUuid":"898b4736-9a17-4379-9411-614719374528","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGJBqhQGTNUASnesR9Ss","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":698587,"output_tokens":1953,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1390},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":796,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1953,"cache_read_input_tokens":698587,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":796},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGJBmEmMjCBFo9MHddEY","type":"assistant","uuid":"7ad2421a-fd32-480d-a9f6-2320c2d2be96","timestamp":"2026-08-21T17:35:32.653Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"7ad2421a-fd32-480d-a9f6-2320c2d2be96","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGJBqhQGTNUASnesR9Ss","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You were right, and my earlier claim of a bug was wrong. Confirmed by both sources:\n\n**Callisto's own spec/code**: §7.5 documents Fixed groups explicitly — \"members always share the exact version\" — and `groups.rs`'s `fixed_group_target` genuinely computes `max_sev` across the group and bumps from an aligned base (that's Track 1's work from earlier this session, already tested). **But** membership is config-driven only (§7.5: \"a fixed group's `members` list is config, and config is authoritative\") — nothing auto-detects `version.workspace = true` as implying group membership.\n\n**Knope** (per its own docs): packages version independently by default too; no automatic cross-package convergence — grouping is opt-in, same pattern as callisto.\n\n**The actual gap**: `callisto.toml` has zero `[[fixed-group]]` declarations right now. These 10 crates share Cargo's `version.workspace = true` (a Cargo-only mechanism), but callisto itself doesn't know they should be treated as one group — so each gets an independently-pinned version (spec §CM.4.4, deliberate, tested behavior), which is exactly why the dry-run showed diverging targets. That's not a bug in `apply_version_plan` — the code path I flagged earlier (`CargoWorkspacePackage`) is explicitly documented in the spec as dead code with \"no live production caller.\" I was wrong to call it a bug.\n\n**Fix**: add a `[[fixed-group]]` to `callisto.toml` listing all the packages, which activates the already-built, already-tested max-severity convergence. Want me to add that and verify with another dry-run that it actually produces one uniform target version for everyone?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":698587,"output_tokens":1953,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1390},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":796,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1953,"cache_read_input_tokens":698587,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":796},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGJBmEmMjCBFo9MHddEY","type":"assistant","uuid":"34a2d107-e17d-4a27-967c-d8f3cce6e722","timestamp":"2026-08-21T17:35:38.072Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
