{"parentUuid":"c5cf8044-851a-4e1f-a93b-db41da96c6b0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGLtuL4D6uTdRMy8xzJJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clippy clean. Committing both the regression test and the `callisto.toml` fixed-group config together (they're the same logical change: prove the engine's convergence guarantee, then activate it for this repo)."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":503,"cache_read_input_tokens":741511,"output_tokens":874,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":380},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":503,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":874,"cache_read_input_tokens":741511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":503,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":503},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGLtqU8eUGRzBB5KDxQB","type":"assistant","uuid":"c30e559c-91ac-4996-934c-a931bfaa79c0","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:10:53.259Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"c30e559c-91ac-4996-934c-a931bfaa79c0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGLtuL4D6uTdRMy8xzJJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012JHFNMspFosYUatwwUAeQ7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add crates/callisto-graph/tests/version_tests.rs callisto.toml && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(config): declare workspace as a fixed group; pin no-compounding guarantee\n\nAll 10 crates share Cargo's version.workspace = true, but callisto had\nno config telling it these packages should release in lockstep --\nwithout a declared [[fixed-group]], each package was independently\npinned to its own changeset-derived version, producing diverging\ntarget versions (e.g. 0.3.4 for patch-severity packages vs 0.4.0 for\nminor-severity ones) even though they all share one physical version\nfield.\n\nDeclaring them as a fixed group activates the existing, already-tested\nmax-severity convergence (groups.rs's fixed_group_target): every\npackage now bumps to the same target, with lower-severity packages\npicked up via BumpReason::FixedGroupUnion.\n\nAlso adds a regression test proving the convergence is a single bump,\nnot compounded: two separate changesets (one per fixed-group member,\neach minor severity) must produce exactly one minor step from the\nshared base, not two stacked minor bumps.\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":503,"cache_read_input_tokens":741511,"output_tokens":874,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":380},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":503,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":874,"cache_read_input_tokens":741511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":503,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":503},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGLtqU8eUGRzBB5KDxQB","type":"assistant","uuid":"d82d4727-daf6-4df8-90ae-4b320f2c5685","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:10:57.457Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
