{"parentUuid":"c778c995-269f-44d1-b711-8e377d831782","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ef104ad3-6fa5-4537-a098-be1c6f44b9c4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jPgNmK1G62jjHAYosG13a","type":"tool_result","content":"186 06-publishing.md\n189 release-paradigms.md\nΣ 375\n# Callisto Monorepo Release Paradigms & CI/CD Safety\n\nCallisto supports three release paradigms. Each gates publishing behind CI verification, but they differ in branching model and how much manual coordination they require.\n\n---\n\n## Overview Matrix\n\n| Paradigm | Branching Model | Trigger Mechanism | Developer Overhead | Safety Assurance |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Paradigm 1 (Default)** | Single Trunk (`main`) | Version PR Merge + Gated CI | Low (Automated) | High (`needs: [verify]`) |\n| **Paradigm 2** | Dedicated Release (`release`) | Branch Sync / Fast-Forward | Medium (Branch Management) | High (Isolated Branch) |\n| **Paradigm 3** | Git Tag-Driven | Tag Push (`*@*`, `v*`) | Medium (Tag Orchestration) | High (Immutable Commit SHA) |\n\n---\n\n## Paradigm 1: Single Trunk (`main`) + Gated CI Verification (Default)\n\n### Architecture\nAll development lands on `main`. Callisto automatically generates a Version PR (`callisto/version-packages`) when changesets are present. Merging the Version PR to `main` triggers a two-stage release workflow:\n[169 more lines]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"61e95a61-14c7-44df-b54e-b541bdfc9c87","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:53:29.904Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"186 06-publishing.md\n189 release-paradigms.md\nΣ 375\n# Callisto Monorepo Release Paradigms & CI/CD Safety\n\nCallisto supports three release paradigms. Each gates publishing behind CI verification, but they differ in branching model and how much manual coordination they require.\n\n---\n\n## Overview Matrix\n\n| Paradigm | Branching Model | Trigger Mechanism | Developer Overhead | Safety Assurance |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Paradigm 1 (Default)** | Single Trunk (`main`) | Version PR Merge + Gated CI | Low (Automated) | High (`needs: [verify]`) |\n| **Paradigm 2** | Dedicated Release (`release`) | Branch Sync / Fast-Forward | Medium (Branch Management) | High (Isolated Branch) |\n| **Paradigm 3** | Git Tag-Driven | Tag Push (`*@*`, `v*`) | Medium (Tag Orchestration) | High (Immutable Commit SHA) |\n\n---\n\n## Paradigm 1: Single Trunk (`main`) + Gated CI Verification (Default)\n\n### Architecture\nAll development lands on `main`. Callisto automatically generates a Version PR (`callisto/version-packages`) when changesets are present. Merging the Version PR to `main` triggers a two-stage release workflow:\n[169 more lines]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c778c995-269f-44d1-b711-8e377d831782","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
