{"parentUuid":"0b8c9491-a77c-41b4-a02e-efb9737f46b0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGQPPU6yycUsvy4AX3TD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":845,"cache_read_input_tokens":785156,"output_tokens":1578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":955},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":845,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1578,"cache_read_input_tokens":785156,"cache_creation_input_tokens":845,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":845},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGQPLPZkJCPzu7RVB3yP","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e0f4ef9-c683-4fb8-ad54-552d33af1e7d","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:56:45.527Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"5e0f4ef9-c683-4fb8-ad54-552d33af1e7d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGQPPU6yycUsvy4AX3TD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read the full action line by line against everything shipped. Two conclusions:\n\n**No changes needed, confirmed for real this time**: `.platformTargets[].targets[].artifactName` and `.releases[].tagName` match `MatrixReport`/`PublishPlan`'s exact current field names (checked the struct defs directly, not just grep). `callisto-validate` is wired into `callisto-ci.yml` with no `|| true`, so it correctly fails CI on a real validate error — including the new `AmbiguousPackageName` diagnostic I added today. Everything holds.\n\n**One genuine simplification I found**: the GitHub Release step (lines 200-216) guesses whether a tag is a prerelease by regexing the *tag string* for `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)`:\n\n```bash\nif [[ \"$TAG\" =~ -(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next) ]]; then\n  EXTRA_FLAGS=\"--prerelease\"\nfi\n```\n\nBut `ReleaseEntry` (`plan.rs:111`) only carries `package`, `tagName`, `sha`, `changelogSection` — no prerelease flag. So this bash regex is a workaround for missing data, not a stylistic choice. It'll silently misclassify any custom `tag_template` that doesn't literally embed one of those substrings — even though callisto's own `Version` type already computes `is_prerelease()` correctly internally (and we just fixed a PEP 440 bug in exactly that logic this session).\n\nThe real fix: add a `pre_release: bool` field to `ReleaseEntry`, computed from the release's own `Version::is_prerelease()` at `plan_publish` construction time, and have the action read that field via `jq` instead of regexing the tag string. Small, additive, non-breaking.\n\nWant me to add that now, or note it as a follow-up and leave this PR as-is?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":845,"cache_read_input_tokens":785156,"output_tokens":1578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":955},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":845,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1578,"cache_read_input_tokens":785156,"cache_creation_input_tokens":845,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":845},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGQPLPZkJCPzu7RVB3yP","type":"assistant","uuid":"d5c39765-f5c6-4d7e-af2e-4c019159f427","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:56:50.643Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
