{"parentUuid":"bd82ea38-7766-4672-817f-9eb8de012a35","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGQZpJ8Kkj81zmcDUiDc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Nnj3UgSwtkxZYvSyKuvxue","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"knope changesets GitHub release prerelease detection tag semver \"pre-release\" flag field"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":137,"cache_read_input_tokens":787579,"output_tokens":2283,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2181},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":137,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2283,"cache_read_input_tokens":787579,"cache_creation_input_tokens":137,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":137},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGQZkbdMiGBRqNfJmgHW","type":"assistant","uuid":"3d4bb863-5d13-42c8-be9f-07a20f884258","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:59:19.901Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"3d4bb863-5d13-42c8-be9f-07a20f884258","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bda760ce-6576-45ed-9527-0e82452684f1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nnj3UgSwtkxZYvSyKuvxue","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"knope changesets GitHub release prerelease detection tag semver \"pre-release\" flag field\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"🚀 Use regular semver instead of prerelease tags on `next` releases · Issue #22636 · backstage/backstage\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/backstage/backstage/issues/22636\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - knope-dev/changesets: A Rust crate for parsing and creating changesets—Markdown files describing releases\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/knope-dev/changesets\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction - Knope\",\"url\":\"https://knope-dev.github.io/knope/\"},{\"title\":\"[ISSUE]: Semver on release branch containing prerelease number. · Issue #4175 · GitTools/GitVersion\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/GitTools/GitVersion/issues/4175\"},{\"title\":\"PrepareRelease | Knope\",\"url\":\"https://knope.tech/reference/config-file/steps/prepare-release/\"},{\"title\":\"Actions · GitHub Marketplace - Semver Release\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/semver-release\"},{\"title\":\"changesets/docs/prereleases.md at main · changesets/changesets\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/blob/main/docs/prereleases.md\"},{\"title\":\"semantic-release vs changesets vs release-it 2026 — PkgPulse Guides\",\"url\":\"https://www.pkgpulse.com/guides/semantic-release-vs-changesets-vs-release-it-release-2026\"},{\"title\":\"semver tag\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/akshens/semver-tag\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found relevant information about Knope and its handling of prerelease versions:\n\nKnope is a Rust crate implementing changesets—Markdown files describing releases. If you want a CLI which supports this format, check out Knope.\n\nRegarding prerelease detection and configuration, Knope's PrepareRelease step has a `prerelease_label` option. If set, this step will create a pre-release version using the specified label. This can also be set dynamically using the --prerelease-label command line argument.\n\nAdditionally, Knope uses the last \"version tag\" as the starting point to read commits—that's the most recent tag that the Release step created. See that step for details on the tagging formats.\n\nFor GitHub releases specifically, there's a related tool that provides prerelease detection capabilities: The semver-tag GitHub action has an `is-prerelease` output that indicates whether the version is a pre-release.\n\nThe search results show that Knope is implemented in Rust, intended primarily for use by Knope, and it handles semantic versioning and prerelease tagging as part of its release management workflow.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d1df14eb-82b9-44cb-b0a0-52bd0436090f","timestamp":"2026-08-21T18:59:27.912Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"knope changesets GitHub release prerelease detection tag semver \"pre-release\" flag field","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01KNUUK6Qw3ZUwJWWNyAAr2r","content":[{"title":"🚀 Use regular semver instead of prerelease tags on `next` releases · Issue #22636 · backstage/backstage","url":"https://github.com/backstage/backstage/issues/22636"},{"title":"GitHub - knope-dev/changesets: A Rust crate for parsing and creating changesets—Markdown files describing releases","url":"https://github.com/knope-dev/changesets"},{"title":"Introduction - Knope","url":"https://knope-dev.github.io/knope/"},{"title":"[ISSUE]: Semver on release branch containing prerelease number. · Issue #4175 · GitTools/GitVersion","url":"https://github.com/GitTools/GitVersion/issues/4175"},{"title":"PrepareRelease | Knope","url":"https://knope.tech/reference/config-file/steps/prepare-release/"},{"title":"Actions · GitHub Marketplace - Semver Release","url":"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/semver-release"},{"title":"changesets/docs/prereleases.md at main · changesets/changesets","url":"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/blob/main/docs/prereleases.md"},{"title":"semantic-release vs changesets vs release-it 2026 — PkgPulse Guides","url":"https://www.pkgpulse.com/guides/semantic-release-vs-changesets-vs-release-it-release-2026"},{"title":"semver tag","url":"https://github.com/akshens/semver-tag"}]},"Based on the web search results, I found relevant information about Knope and its handling of prerelease versions:\n\nKnope is a Rust crate implementing changesets—Markdown files describing releases. If you want a CLI which supports this format, check out Knope.\n\nRegarding prerelease detection and configuration, Knope's PrepareRelease step has a `prerelease_label` option. If set, this step will create a pre-release version using the specified label. This can also be set dynamically using the --prerelease-label command line argument.\n\nAdditionally, Knope uses the last \"version tag\" as the starting point to read commits—that's the most recent tag that the Release step created. See that step for details on the tagging formats.\n\nFor GitHub releases specifically, there's a related tool that provides prerelease detection capabilities: The semver-tag GitHub action has an `is-prerelease` output that indicates whether the version is a pre-release.\n\nThe search results show that Knope is implemented in Rust, intended primarily for use by Knope, and it handles semantic versioning and prerelease tagging as part of its release management workflow."],"durationSeconds":6.546126667007804,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3d4bb863-5d13-42c8-be9f-07a20f884258","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardeni