e concrete. But: one real off-nominal-input gap (missing isPrerelease key in the Action's JSON read) that reproduces the spec's own motivating bug class if left unhandled; a genuine correlation ambiguity in AC-003-006; two is_error_case mislabelings that would mislead downstream planning/gating tools about what error coverage exists; and a confirmed scope collision with SPEC-TRACK4 on the identical struct-literal edit site with no coordination language. These are fixable with the rewrites given, but as written the spec does not pass.\"\n}\n```\n\nFile audited: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-005-release-entry-is-prerelease.json`\nOverlap check performed against: `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK4-RELEASE-PIPELINE-CONTRACT-CORRECTNESS.json` (confirmed collision), plus `SPEC-TRACK3B2-CONSUMER-COLLISION-SAFETY.json` and `track-g-matrix-napi-maturin.json` (matched only on incidental \"prerelease\" substring, no real overlap).\nSource files cross-checked: `crates/callisto-model/src/plan.rs`, `crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/publish.rs`, `crates/callisto-model/src/version.rs`, `.github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml`, `docs/01-spec.md`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>59057</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>8</tool_uses><duration_ms>142596</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"091f02aa-5652-42c3-97c5-c52adfcbfb6f","timestamp":"2026-08-21T19:09:22.118Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
