{"parentUuid":"2cb8f28b-2cde-4c09-b321-bd39e5b04c4c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGRSNo8DQsXefCV3cpr3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XzZBJcBENJ1BRA8RBbcGZe","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Exit-gate SPEC-005","subagent_type":"canon:exit-gate","prompt":"Gate the spec@1 at /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-005-release-entry-is-prerelease.json (read it from disk now). This is a revised version after one audit round fixed: a missing-key error case (AC-015 added), a correlation ambiguity in AC-003/004/005/006 (now correlate by `package` field), two mislabeled is_error_case criteria (AC-012 split into AC-012a/AC-012b as non-error criteria, AC-013 reworded and relabeled as non-error), and a scope-overlap note added to non_goals re: SPEC-TRACK4 (already implemented/committed, touches the same struct-literal block).\n\nComplete the ENTIRE gate check in this single turn and return the full verdict (pass/fail, with specific blockers if fail) as your final answer -- do not just describe what you're about to do. This is retry_count=1 (one prior audit round already happened and was addressed, this is the first formal exit-gate pass)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":215,"cache_read_input_tokens":825291,"output_tokens":457,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":215,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":825291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":215,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":215},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGRSJ