{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-21T19:35:03.278Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a1a88021f4efd849a</task-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/c0ad64b2-6440-4937-8328-8d9fd9db278c/tasks/a1a88021f4efd849a.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Produce plan@1 for SPEC-005\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>The plan@1 for SPEC-005 is complete and written to disk.\n\n**File:** `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/plans/PLAN-005-release-entry-is-prerelease.json`\n\n**Summary of the decomposition (6 tasks, 6 batches):**\n\n- **T1** — Adds `ReleaseEntry.is_prerelease: bool` to `crates/callisto-model/src/plan.rs`, populates it at the real construction site in `crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/publish.rs` via `ver.is_prerelease()`, and fixes all 7 sibling struct literals (`crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/publish.rs`, `tag_sha_fabrication_test.rs`, and 5 sites in `tags_tests.rs`) — all in one task, per the critical constraint, so no commit leaves the workspace non-compiling. Covers AC-001, AC-007, AC-012b.\n- **T2** — Fixture-value regression tests across SemVer non-prerelease, SemVer numeric-prerelease, PEP 440 dev-release, and PEP 440 alpha-release, asserting both the Rust boolean and the serialized `isPrerelease` JSON key. Covers AC-002–AC-006.\n- **T3** — Updates `crates/callisto-cli/tests/schema_guard_test.rs`'s expected required/property sets and its permitted-delta allowlist doc comment. Covers AC-012a.\n- **T4** — Structural/grep verification: no conditional branch wrapping the new field assignment, no new Cargo dependency, no AGPL edge in `cargo metadata`, full workspace suite green. Covers AC-013, AC-014, AC-012c.\n- **T5** — Rewrites `.github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml`'s GitHub Release loop to read `isPrerelease` per-entry (removing the old `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)` regex) and hard-fail on missing/null/non-boolean values, with a new bash regression test (`tests/test_github_release_prerelease_flag.sh`) written first against the unedited action.yml to prove genuine red. Covers AC-008, AC-009, AC-010, AC-015.\n- **T6** — Documents the field in `docs/01-spec.md`'s `ReleaseEntry` doc block plus a new decision-table row 24. Covers AC-011.\n\nAll 17 acceptance criteria (AC-001 through AC-015, with AC-012 split into a/b/c) are each covered exactly once, verified against live source (struct definition, all 8 construction sites, schema guard assertions, and the Action's release loop were read directly, not guessed). `spec_hash` is `sha256:5217011e7d8615e8a49f8b7cb2aed232369e97e19f32d52fd0d5edf5eef6361b`, `linked_requirement` is `REQ-008`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>67384</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>3</tool_uses><duration_ms>761526</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
