{"parentUuid":"a015823f-2d2d-4fe0-bb6c-eb0558bb2ef0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGczF7wCzK9f9oqdGjtN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JbB5zLVNX5eQdosKUZXeSB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n \"^| 2[0-9] \\|^|23\\b\\|row 23\\|^### .*[Dd]ecision\" /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/docs/01-spec.md | sed -n '1,40p'"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":832,"cache_read_input_tokens":98898,"output_tokens":140,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":832,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":140,"cache_read_input_tokens":98898,"cache_creation_input_tokens":832,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":832},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGczENHryorPjF7azGxF","type":"assistant","uuid":"575326a6-6ba6-4a6c-84df-029431c6eda0","timestamp":"2026-08-21T21:41:49.629Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"575326a6-6ba6-4a6c-84df-029431c6eda0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f5c3712b-9d58-46b9-ad02-83bddc7fe7dc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JbB5zLVNX5eQdosKUZXeSB","type":"tool_result","content":"2671:| 20 | §M.13.2 | `ManifestError` is declared in `callisto-model`, not `callisto-manifests` (feature-flag reason). |\n2672:| 21 | §M.7.3 | Workspace inheritance is signalled by `DependencyEntry::inherited` (and carried onto `DepEdge::inherited`), not by a `DepSpec` variant or method. |\n2673:| 22 | §M.2 | `PackageId::name()` is the identity's name component, explicitly **not** a publish-target name; plan entries source names from `IdentityIndex::native_name` because a Case D package can have two divergent native names. |\n2674:| 23 | §M.12.2 | `ReleaseEntry.changelog_section` is `Option<String>`, produced by reading the written `CHANGELOG.md` back (§CL.7.1). |\n8877:| 20 | §G.7.7 | Round-trip fidelity is verified by re-parse plus re-coverage, not asserted by the renderer; the grammar half is `callisto-manifests::round_trip`'s. |\n8878:| 21 | §G.8.3 | The aligned-base fallback for a fixed group with no released member. |\n8879:| 22 | §G.8.4 | napi drift compares target **triples** via a localized table, not derived package names. |\n8880:| 23 | §G.10.2 | §7.6's mutation ordering (`apply_version_plan`) lives in `callisto-graph`. |\n8881:| 24 | §G.11 | `commands::init` exists here, with the pinned signature. |\n8882:| 25 | §G.12 | `GraphError` gains transparent `Config`/`Changelog`/`Conventional` wrappers plus `WorkspaceVersionConflict`; `ConfigError` is declared here. |\n8883:| 26 | §G.5.1 | `[[fixed-group]]`/`[[linked-group]]` are a config layer, ranked between `[[package]]` and `[[package-set]]`, carrying per-package keys only (§14's `pre-major-inference` availability made resolvable). |\n8884:| 27 | §G.5.1 | `moon.yml`'s block also accepts `pre-major-inference` and `changelog`; it accepts no workspace-level key. |\n8885:| 28 | §G.7.3 | Dependency-spec writes carry a typed `DepWriteTarget`; `RewriteKey.kind` is `None` for a Cargo workspace-root target so inheriting members collapse to one rewrite. |\n8886:| 29 | §G.10.1 | `PlannedBump.writes` carries typed `VersionWriteTarget`s, disambiguating `[workspace.package].version` from a root package's own `[package].version`. |\n10924:### 11.1 Spec decisions, by crate","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"10b98d79-b31a-43ee-9579-7a8f9b243a4b","timestamp":"2026-08-21T21:41:49.709Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"2671:| 20 | §M.13.2 | `ManifestError` is declared in `callisto-model`, not `callisto-manifests` (feature-flag reason). |\n2672:| 21 | §M.7.3 | Workspace inheritance is signalled by `DependencyEntry::inherited` (and carried onto `DepEdge::inherited`), not by a `DepSpec` variant or method. |\n2673:| 22 | §M.2 | `PackageId::name()` is the identity's name component, explicitly **not** a publish-target name; plan entries source names from `IdentityIndex::native_name` because a Case D package can have two divergent native names. |\n2674:| 23 | §M.12.2 | `ReleaseEntry.changelog_section` is `Option<String>`, produced by reading the written `CHANGELOG.md` back (§CL.7.1). |\n8877:| 20 | §G.7.7 | Round-trip fidelity is verified by re-parse plus re-coverage, not asserted by the renderer; the grammar half is `callisto-manifests::round_trip`'s. |\n8878:| 21 | §G.8.3 | The aligned-base fallback for a fixed group with no released member. |\n8879:| 22 | §G.8.4 | napi drift compares target **triples** via a localized table, not derived package names. |\n8880:| 23 | §G.10.2 | §7.6's mutation ordering (`apply_version_plan`) lives in `callisto-graph`. |\n8881:| 24 | §G.11 | `commands::init` exists here, with the pinned signature. |\n8882:| 25 | §G.12 | `GraphError` gains transparent `Config`/`Changelog`/`Conventional` wrappers plus `WorkspaceVersionConflict`; `ConfigError` is declared here. |\n8883:| 26 | §G.5.1 | `[[fixed-group]]`/`[[linked-group]]` are a config layer, ranked between `[[package]]` and `[[package-set]]`, carrying per-package keys only (§14's `pre-major-inference` availability made resolvable). |\n8884:| 27 | §G.5.1 | `moon.yml`'s block also accepts `pre-major-inference` and `changelog`; it accepts no workspace-level key. |\n8885:| 28 | §G.7.3 | Dependency-spec writes carry a typed `DepWriteTarget`; `RewriteKey.kind` is `None` for a Cargo workspace-root target so inheriting members collapse to one rewrite. |\n8886:| 29 | §G.10.1 | `PlannedBump.writes` carries typed `VersionWriteTarget`s, disambiguating `[workspace.package].version` from a root package's own `[package].version`. |\n10924:### 11.1 Spec decisions, by crate","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"575326a6-6ba6-4a6c-84df-029431c6eda0","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
