.md) — Skip canon ceremony for targeted bug fixes with RED tests already written; canon auditor loops infinitely on implementation-detail prose.\n11\t- [Workspace Audit 2026-08](project_workspace_audit_2026-08.md) — Full 8-dimension adversarial audit after Track G shipped; 3 critical bugs confirmed (publish version-parse failure, silent NuGet/GitHubRelease no-op, changelog path traversal), report published as artifact.\n12\t- [Found Code Needs Same Rigor](feedback_found_code_needs_same_rigor.md) — Committing pre-existing uncommitted code after only \"compiles + existing tests pass\" missed a zero-test-coverage regression; found/inherited code needs the same TDD/adversarial rigor as freshly-written code.\n13\t- [Manifest Persist Track](project_manifest_persist_track.md) — Both Spec A (mutate/persist split) and Spec B (write-batching) shipped; the apply_version_plan redundant-open/persist audit finding is fully closed.\n14\t- [Reviewer Must Actually Run Checks](feedback_reviewer_must_actually_run_checks.md) — lambda-reviewer falsely reported clippy clean once; always instruct review agents to run commands for real, not infer results.\n15\t- [Iterate Reviews in Foreground](feedback_iterate_reviews_in_foreground.md) — Background agent notifications were unreliable across a multi-round spec/plan review loop; user called it out twice — run tight revise-review cycles in the foreground.\n16\t"}]},"uuid":"03e58882-df2f-4f01-ac1c-f4bc889480f5","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:01:35.421Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory/MEMORY.md","content":"# Memory Index\n\n- [Hardcoded Values — Proactive Search Required](feedback_hardcoded_values.md) — User repeatedly frustrated by missed hardcoded values; always include a dedicated pass in any audit or fix session.\n- [Track 0: gix WASI spike — NO-GO verdict](project_track0_wasi_verdict.md) — mmap ENOSYS in WASI blocks all gix object reads; callisto-moon exec-se