{"parentUuid":"7f39224f-1560-4b4a-80dd-a26376b2c30d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bf945d21-181c-4852-9350-367b2062f80e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012CGik113hFf41nf3jRY3Wy","type":"tool_result","content":"=== tags ===\ncallisto-manifests@0\ncallisto-manifests@0.1.0\ncallisto-manifests@0.2.0\ncallisto-manifests@0.3.1\ncallisto-manifests@0.3.2\ncallisto-model@0\ncallisto-model@0.1.0\ncallisto-model@0.2.0\ncallisto-model@0.3.1\ncallisto-model@0.3.2\ncallisto-moon@0\ncallisto-moon@0.1.0\ncallisto-moon@0.2.0\ncallisto-moon@0.3.1\ncallisto-moon@0.3.2\ncallisto-vcs@0\ncallisto-vcs@0.1.0\ncallisto-vcs@0.2.0\ncallisto-vcs@0.3.1\ncallisto-vcs@0.3.2\n=== last CHANGELOG entries (top of file) for a couple packages ===\n--- crates/callisto-graph/CHANGELOG.md ---\n# callisto-graph\n\n## 0.3.3\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- # Security hardening, correctness fixes, and performance improvements\n  \n  ## Security\n  \n  - **Argument injection in publish client** (`callisto-graph`): Package names are now validated before being passed to `cargo publish`, `npm publish`, and `pypi publish`. Names beginning with `-` are rejected with an error, preventing a crafted package name from injecting flags into the subprocess.\n  - **Path traversal in `changesets.dir` config** (`callisto-graph`): The `changesets.dir` value from `callisto.toml` is now validated to contain no `..` components. A value like `../../tmp` previously allowed all changeset read and write operations to escape the workspace root.\n  \n  ## Correctness\n  \n--- crates/callisto-model/CHANGELOG.md ---\n# callisto-model\n\n## 0.3.2\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Release update\n\n## 0.3.0\n\n### Minor Changes\n\n- Release update\n\n--- crates/callisto-cli/CHANGELOG.md ---\n# callisto-cli\n\n## 0.3.3\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- # Security hardening, correctness fixes, and performance improvements\n  \n  ## Security\n  \n  - **Argument injection in publish client** (`callisto-graph`): Package names are now validated before being passed to `cargo publish`, `npm publish`, and `pypi publish`. Names beginning with `-` are rejected with an error, preventing a crafted package name from injecting flags into the subprocess.\n  - **Path traversal in `changesets.dir` config** (`callisto-graph`): The `changesets.dir` value from `callisto.toml` is now validated to contain no `..` components. A value like `../../tmp` previously allowed all changeset read and write operations to escape the workspace root.\n  \n  ## Correctness","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"db2cbf42-08c1-48cc-97ee-75eeefe15b34","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:30:22.249Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== tags ===\ncallisto-manifests@0\ncallisto-manifests@0.1.0\ncallisto-manifests@0.2.0\ncallisto-manifests@0.3.1\ncallisto-manifests@0.3.2\ncallisto-model@0\ncallisto-model@0.1.0\ncallisto-model@0.2.0\ncallisto-model@0.3.1\ncallisto-model@0.3.2\ncallisto-moon@0\ncallisto-moon@0.1.0\ncallisto-moon@0.2.0\ncallisto-moon@0.3.1\ncallisto-moon@0.3.2\ncallisto-vcs@0\ncallisto-vcs@0.1.0\ncallisto-vcs@0.2.0\ncallisto-vcs@0.3.1\ncallisto-vcs@0.3.2\n=== last CHANGELOG entries (top of file) for a couple packages ===\n--- crates/callisto-graph/CHANGELOG.md ---\n# callisto-graph\n\n## 0.3.3\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- # Security hardening, correctness fixes, and performance improvements\n  \n  ## Security\n  \n  - **Argument injection in publish client** (`callisto-graph`): Package names are now validated before being passed to `cargo publish`, `npm publish`, and `pypi publish`. Names beginning with `-` are rejected with an error, preventing a crafted package name from injecting flags into the subprocess.\n  - **Path traversal in `changesets.dir` config** (`callisto-graph`): The `changesets.dir` value from `callisto.toml` is now validated to contain no `..` components. A value like `../../tmp` previously allowed all changeset read and write operations to escape the workspace root.\n  \n  ## Correctness\n  \n--- crates/callisto-model/CHANGELOG.md ---\n# callisto-model\n\n## 0.3.2\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Release update\n\n## 0.3.0\n\n### Minor Changes\n\n- Release update\n\n--- crates/callisto-cli/CHANGELOG.md ---\n# callisto-cli\n\n## 0.3.3\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- # Security hardening, correctness fixes, and performance improvements\n  \n  ## Security\n  \n  - **Argument injection in publish client** (`callisto-graph`): Package names are now validated before being passed to `cargo publish`, `npm publish`, and `pypi publish`. Names beginning with `-` are rejected with an error, preventing a crafted package name from injecting flags into the subprocess.\n  - **Path traversal in `changesets.dir` config** (`callisto-graph`): The `changesets.dir` value from `callisto.toml` is now validated to contain no `..` components. A value like `../../tmp` previously allowed all changeset read and write operations to escape the workspace root.\n  \n  ## Correctness","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7f39224f-1560-4b4a-80dd-a26376b2c30d","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
