{"parentUuid":"6604cac8-1ada-4032-90d7-dff48eac1aee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGgrjSWXpHC6NjxcuHiw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've now traced the real diff since the last release (`f40d87b8`, 376 commits) rather than working from the bundled file's prose alone. Here's the accurate per-topic package attribution, verified against actual `git diff` per track/commit-range (not guessed):\n\n| New changeset | Packages (severity) | Scope |\n|---|---|---|\n| `fixed-group-convergence.md` | callisto-graph (minor) | Track 1: fixed-group siblings converge to one target; `pre_mutation_checks`/divergence wiring; `ConflictingGroupMembership` detection; this session's `[[fixed-group]]` config + no-compounding test |\n| `platform-manifest-planning.md` | callisto-graph (minor) | Track 2: real `platform_writes`/`optional_dep_updates` planning logic |\n| `cascade-severity-fixes.md` | callisto-graph (patch) | Track 9: peer-escalation respects true severity; cross-ecosystem rewrite-key fix |\n| `identity-ecosystem-resolution.md` | callisto-graph (minor) | Track 3a/3b1: workspace-membership filtering, ecosystem-prefixed identity, cross-ecosystem promotion, fallback removal |\n| `release-pipeline-contract.md` | callisto-model, callisto-graph, callisto-cli, callisto-moon (minor) | Track 4 + Track 6-mechanical + SPEC-005: tag-sha fix, `status --check` fix, JSON report renames, `ReleaseEntry.is_prerelease` + Action rewrite |\n| `changelog-pr-body-rendering.md` | callisto-graph (minor) | Track 5: one renderer everywhere, `ChangeSource` construction, entry union |\n| `callisto-matrix-command.md` | callisto-cli, callisto-graph, callisto-model (minor) | Track G: `callisto matrix` napi/maturin discovery |\n| `manifest-write-batching.md` | callisto-graph, callisto-manifests, callisto-model (minor) | Spec A + Spec B: `Manifest::persist` required, write-batching |\n| `security-hardening.md` | callisto-graph, callisto-vcs, callisto-cli (patch), callisto-model (minor — new `LeadingHyphen` variant) | publish name validation, registry allowlist, path traversal, credential redaction, tag hyphen rejection, bounded subprocess capture |\n| `vcs-conventional-decoupling-and-fixes.md` | callisto-conventional (minor — `CommitWalker` decoupling), callisto-vcs, callisto-graph, callisto-model, callisto-format (patch) | `CommitWalker` trait decoupling, `GitAccess` sharing, cached `TagIndex`, branchy-history fix, BREAKING-CHANGE footer parser, PEP440 normalization, caret-range fix, diagnostic-code dedup |\n\nOne thing I'm **not** silently guessing on: a few micro-bullets (Python dependency-name PEP503 normalization, npm package-manager auto-detection, Cargo compound dependency-range rewriting) I haven't pinned to an exact file yet — I'll verify each before filing rather than place them by assumption.\n\n`callisto-fixtures` genuinely has zero diffs in this window — it gets no changeset entry (it'll still bump via fixed-group convergence, which is correct, separate from changeset content).\n\nWant me to proceed with this split, or adjust the grouping first?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":481,"cache_read_input_tokens":190575,"output_tokens":7554,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":6371},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":481,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":7554,"cache_read_input_tokens":190575,"cache_creation_input_tokens":481,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":481},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGgrhzwuBQrYFDbNrVcB","type":"assistant","uuid":"0f761924-4e2b-4e53-909b-d4c9dd5ca4df","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:33:55.762Z","effo