{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"bf35f195-7330-4d93-963c-270450cc5bf1","snapshotMessageId":"04394f46-f661-4838-b82b-85739f41259a","trackingPath":".changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-08-21T22:37:16.786Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset"},"timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:16.797Z"}
{"parentUuid":"2b6da5a1-f22f-4153-b659-9c11103c62de","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGhDAJnp464Q6fexMLJu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Wh9tsywKbNf6abRx9YKQos","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","content":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n# Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **JSON report fields renamed** — visible via `callisto-cli --format json`:\n  - `ValidateReport.valid` → `ok`\n  - `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body` → `body`\n  - `TagReport.created_tags` → `tags` (plus new `already_existed: bool`)\n  - `StatusReport` gained `hasChangesets`, `lastReleasedVersion`, `releaseTrigger`\n  - `ReleaseEntry` gained a required `isPrerelease: bool`, computed from the resolved version (covers both SemVer's `-` prerelease component and PEP 440's dev/pre segments)\n  - Update anything parsing this JSON, including the shipped GitHub Action.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha`: when a tag already exists at a different commit, it now resolves the real target via `git rev-parse` (both apply and `--dry-run` modes).\n- The shipped GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes (1 = pending, 2 = none pending) — the release-PR creation step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's GitHub Release creation loop now reads each release entry's `isPrerelease` field directly instead of guessing from the tag string (the old `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)` regex missed PEP 440 prereleases like `1.2.3a1` entirely), and hard-fails before creating a release if that field is missing or non-boolean rather than silently treating it as `false`.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back for each release instead of always leaving `changelogSection` blank.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":218652,"output_tokens":734,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":218652,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGhD9D4eL5fuk2WF5fEg","type":"assistant","uuid":"bf35f195-7330-4d93-963c-270450cc5bf1","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:16.783Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"bf35f195-7330-4d93-963c-270450cc5bf1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dc0d202e-5626-4519-a868-de7dad954fe3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wh9tsywKbNf6abRx9YKQos","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"0af9fdcf-a67b-4c67-91e1-a77c18cc728f","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:16.841Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","content":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n# Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **JSON report fields renamed** — visible via `callisto-cli --format json`:\n  - `ValidateReport.valid` → `ok`\n  - `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body` → `body`\n  - `TagReport.created_tags` → `tags` (plus new `already_existed: bool`)\n  - `StatusReport` gained `hasChangesets`, `lastReleasedVersion`, `releaseTrigger`\n  - `ReleaseEntry` gained a required `isPrerelease: bool`, computed from the resolved version (covers both SemVer's `-` prerelease component and PEP 440's dev/pre segments)\n  - Update anything parsing this JSON, including the shipped GitHub Action.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha`: when a tag already exists at a different commit, it now resolves the real target via `git rev-parse` (both apply and `--dry-run` modes).\n- The shipped GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes (1 = pending, 2 = none pending) — the release-PR creation step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's GitHub Release creation loop now reads each release entry's `isPrerelease` field directly instead of guessing from the tag string (the old `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)` regex missed PEP 440 prereleases like `1.2.3a1` entirely), and hard-fails before creating a release if that field is missing or non-boolean rather than silently treating it as `false`.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back for each release instead of always leaving `changelogSection` blank.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bf35f195-7330-4d93-963c-270450cc5bf1","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
