{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"5b8b018e-62a3-40df-8a36-58b74690148e","snapshotMessageId":"04394f46-f661-4838-b82b-85739f41259a","trackingPath":".changeset/manifest-write-batching.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-08-21T22:37:26.422Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset"},"timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:26.436Z"}
{"parentUuid":"1dc3d3ae-3d78-4aa4-a243-aa9ef36308ac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGhE6uBjxDezjigE4XwU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B3FNc956ffDbf8swnTKMy6","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/manifest-write-batching.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-manifests: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\n---\n\n# Manifest writes are batched and more reliable\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`Manifest::persist` is now a required trait method.** `write_version`, `update_dependency_spec`, and `update_optional_dependencies` only mutate in memory now — call `persist()` to write. Custom `Manifest` implementors must add it.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `apply_version_plan` is now idempotent, refreshes the npm lockfile, and persists writes correctly — previously risked a lost write.\n- Manifest writes to the same physical file are now batched into one open/mutate/persist cycle, processed strictly in order, closing a stale-handle data-loss bug where two separate write mechanisms touching the same file could clobber each other.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":220451,"output_tokens":371,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":371,"cache_read_input_tokens":220451,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGhE5sRSGyAx6exz9vQy","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b8b018e-62a3-40df-8a36-58b74690148e","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:26.419Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"5b8b018e-62a3-40df-8a36-58b74690148e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dc0d202e-5626-4519-a868-de7dad954fe3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B3FNc956ffDbf8swnTKMy6","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/manifest-write-batching.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"eefddd41-2302-4d61-8f96-1f4b55d523d9","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:26.482Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/manifest-write-batching.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-manifests: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\n---\n\n# Manifest writes are batched and more reliable\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`Manifest::persist` is now a required trait method.** `write_version`, `update_dependency_spec`, and `update_optional_dependencies` only mutate in memory now — call `persist()` to write. Custom `Manifest` implementors must add it.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `apply_version_plan` is now idempotent, refreshes the npm lockfile, and persists writes correctly — previously risked a lost write.\n- Manifest writes to the same physical file are now batched into one open/mutate/persist cycle, processed strictly in order, closing a stale-handle data-loss bug where two separate write mechanisms touching the same file could clobber each other.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5b8b018e-62a3-40df-8a36-58b74690148e","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
