{"parentUuid":"fbd0a532-756b-4278-ae34-7271fe544348","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGhENt7b2m9rsMh9iynV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011bUJDnX6geMYFf3gEZc8sK","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/publish-target-registry-modeling.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n# npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`PublishTarget::Npm.restricted: bool` → `access: Option<NpmAccess>`.** npm's `publishConfig.access` has three real states (unset, public, restricted); a bool couldn't hold them. An explicit `\"public\"` on an unscoped package was previously dropped silently.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- npm dist-tag, PyPI index, and Cargo registry selection are now threaded through the publish boundary consistently.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":525,"cache_read_input_tokens":220863,"output_tokens":310,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":525,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":310,"cache_read_input_tokens":220863,"cache_creation_input_tokens":525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":525},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGhEMwZRiny9Pr2EUZ5b","type":"assistant","uuid":"d08bdb82-b788-474f-a929-ff4d2193f2a3","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:29.386Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","ve