{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"136608e2-dbb0-429e-8dbf-a46510a11d73","snapshotMessageId":"04394f46-f661-4838-b82b-85739f41259a","trackingPath":".changeset/git-layer-and-misc-fixes.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-08-21T22:37:41.657Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset"},"timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:41.679Z"}
{"parentUuid":"f7f846f8-7a54-40b7-a0d4-a6277703f47d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGhF17wr8Pqx7tNzBCnH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VuMxpXfC8dkj2AKiSdTEP3","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/git-layer-and-misc-fixes.md","content":"---\ncallisto-conventional: minor\ncallisto-vcs: patch\ncallisto-graph: patch\ncallisto-model: patch\ncallisto-format: patch\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n# Git-access layer decoupling, performance, and small correctness fixes\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`callisto-conventional` no longer depends on `callisto-vcs`.** `fetch_commits`/`infer_severity` now take `&dyn callisto_model::CommitWalker`; `ConventionalError::Vcs` renamed to `ConventionalError::CommitWalk`.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `BREAKING CHANGE:` commit-footer parsing fixed (`callisto-conventional`).\n- Merged-branch commits crossing the `since` boundary are no longer dropped from `commits_since_with_pathspec` (`callisto-vcs`).\n- Caret-range coverage (`caret_covers`) now correctly excludes pre-release versions — `^1.2.3` no longer incorrectly covers `1.9.0-alpha.1` (`callisto-graph`).\n- Cargo compound dependency-range rewriting now stays within the upper bound (`callisto-manifests`).\n- PEP 440 `is_prerelease`/`VersionReq` normalization fixed (`callisto-model`).\n- Python dependency-name matching now applies PEP 503 normalization (`callisto-model`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-graph`).\n- npm workspace package-manager (pnpm/yarn/bun/npm) is now auto-detected for publish (`callisto-graph`).\n- Several duplicate diagnostic codes — different errors that previously shared one code — now have their own (`callisto-model`, `callisto-format`, `callisto-graph`).\n\n## Performance\n\n- `status`, `plan_snapshot`, `plan_publish`, and `plan_version` now share one `GitAccess` instead of rediscovering the repository per package or command (`callisto-graph`).\n- Tag existence checks now use the cached `TagIndex` instead of a lookup per release (`callisto-graph`).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":221855,"output_tokens":811,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":811,"cache_read_input_tokens":221855,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGhEz3hvYxna1zTsRA7J","type":"assistant","uuid":"136608e2-dbb0-429e-8dbf-a46510a11d73","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:41.642Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"136608e2-dbb0-429e-8dbf-a46510a11d73","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dc0d202e-5626-4519-a868-de7dad954fe3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VuMxpXfC8dkj2AKiSdTEP3","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/git-layer-and-misc-fixes.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"00612581-37c4-4149-9617-395b1d6f6def","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:37:41.731Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/git-layer-and-misc-fixes.md","content":"---\ncallisto-conventional: minor\ncallisto-vcs: patch\ncallisto-graph: patch\ncallisto-model: patch\ncallisto-format: patch\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n# Git-access layer decoupling, performance, and small correctness fixes\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`callisto-conventional` no longer depends on `callisto-vcs`.** `fetch_commits`/`infer_severity` now take `&dyn callisto_model::CommitWalker`; `ConventionalError::Vcs` renamed to `ConventionalError::CommitWalk`.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `BREAKING CHANGE:` commit-footer parsing fixed (`callisto-conventional`).\n- Merged-branch commits crossing the `since` boundary are no longer dropped from `commits_since_with_pathspec` (`callisto-vcs`).\n- Caret-range coverage (`caret_covers`) now correctly excludes pre-release versions — `^1.2.3` no longer incorrectly covers `1.9.0-alpha.1` (`callisto-graph`).\n- Cargo compound dependency-range rewriting now stays within the upper bound (`callisto-manifests`).\n- PEP 440 `is_prerelease`/`VersionReq` normalization fixed (`callisto-model`).\n- Python dependency-name matching now applies PEP 503 normalization (`callisto-model`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-graph`).\n- npm workspace package-manager (pnpm/yarn/bun/npm) is now auto-detected for publish (`callisto-graph`).\n- Several duplicate diagnostic codes — different errors that previously shared one code — now have their own (`callisto-model`, `callisto-format`, `callisto-graph`).\n\n## Performance\n\n- `status`, `plan_snapshot`, `plan_publish`, and `plan_version` now share one `GitAccess` instead of rediscovering the repository per package or command (`callisto-graph`).\n- Tag existence checks now use the cached `TagIndex` instead of a lookup per release (`callisto-graph`).\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"136608e2-dbb0-429e-8dbf-a46510a11d73","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
