{"parentUuid":"45a50133-dd61-4ae2-bed8-2496b634e10d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGhgHBnM2zkoE6GcgvcW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The changeset is split and pushed (commit `4a49301`). Summary of what changed:\n\n- Traced the actual diff since the last release (376 commits, `f40d87b8..HEAD`), not the bundled file's prose, to attribute every bullet to its real touched packages.\n- Split one 9-package mega-changeset into 12 topic-scoped files (fixed-group convergence, platform-manifest planning, cascade fixes, identity resolution, release-pipeline contract, changelog rendering, `callisto matrix`, manifest write-batching, publish-target modeling, security hardening, git-layer/misc fixes, housekeeping) — each listing only the packages it actually touches.\n- Caught one real misattribution in the process: the caret-range prerelease fix lives in `callisto-graph`'s `cascade.rs`, not `callisto-format` as the old bundled file claimed.\n- Verified the split doesn't change the release outcome — `callisto version --dry-run` still converges all 10 packages on `0.3.3 → 0.4.0`, same as before.\n\nCI is running again on the new commit; I'll report when it lands."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_read_input_tokens":233478,"output_tokens":372,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":507,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":233478,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":507},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGhgFwsY1jwZWEju2izd","type":"assist