{"parentUuid":"0e2da109-d324-4356-96ed-94b09214cd4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGi81Riz4GbHBaLSiinY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3463,"cache_read_input_tokens":240235,"output_tokens":2385,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1980},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3463,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2385,"cache_read_input_tokens":240235,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3463},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGi7zQDGKzm1n8MeEbgU","type":"assistant","uuid":"e6d9cb18-2111-4d5e-a707-c4cd5cda3c03","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:49:32.587Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"e6d9cb18-2111-4d5e-a707-c4cd5cda3c03","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGi81Riz4GbHBaLSiinY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed, not just impression — I rendered it for real. In an isolated clone, `callisto-graph`'s resulting `CHANGELOG.md` for 0.4.0 stacks all 11 changesets that name it, and since each file's body has its own `# Title` plus repeated `## Breaking Changes`/`## Fixes`/`## Performance` sub-headers, the render is 11 nested mini-documents piled under one bullet each — genuinely choppier than the old single document, which had one clean set of top-level headers organizing everything once. (`callisto-vcs`, `callisto-model`, etc. look fine — they only pick up 2-3 files each.)\n\nThe real problem isn't the splitting itself, it's that each file's *body* still carries a full `#`/`##` document structure meant for a standalone file, and that structure doesn't compose when stacked. The fix: keep the per-topic file split (it's still correct — `callisto-format` no longer shows the matrix-command bullet, etc.), but flatten each file's body to a title line plus a flat bullet list, no nested headers — so when several stack under one package, you get one clean bullet list per topic instead of a document-in-a-document.\n\nWant me to reformat all 12 files that way?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3463,"cache_read_input_tokens":240235,"output_tokens":2385,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1980},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3463,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2385,"cache_read_input_tokens":240235,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3463},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGi7zQDGKzm1n8MeEbgU","type":"assistant","uuid":"6fcbe10f-4b18-4bd0-841d-a8037e6396d1","timestamp":"2026-08-21T22:49:37.085Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
