{"parentUuid":"1e397757-8ea8-4bb0-91d1-6a11a5c6eba7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ppz89By9h2zaPsEq1ECmW5","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"90f6f6e9-6457-423c-a7c3-874f96539116","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:05:48.751Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md","oldString":"# Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version\n\n- Siblings","newString":"**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**\n\n- Siblings","originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n# Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version\n\n- Siblings in a `[[fixed-group]]` now bump to one shared target instead of drifting to independent versions when multiple changesets in the group carry different severities.\n- `pre_mutation_checks` (divergence detection, napi-drift detection) is now actually wired into `plan_version`'s orchestration; a diverged group aborts with a clear error instead of silently producing inconsistent versions.\n- `GraphError::ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected: two differently-spelled group-member strings that resolve to the same package across two groups are caught instead of silently accepted.\n- The workspace itself is now declared as a `[[fixed-group]]` in `callisto.toml`, and a regression test pins that two independent changesets in one group converge to a single bump (e.g. two minor changesets converge to one minor bump, not a compounded double bump).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2,"newLines":7,"lines":[" callisto-graph: minor"," ---"," ","-# Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version","+**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**"," "," - Siblings in a `[[fixed-group]]` now bump to one shared target instead of drifting to independent versions when multiple changesets in the group carry different severities."," - `pre_mutation_checks` (divergence detection, napi-drift detection) is now actually wired into `plan_version`'s orchestration; a diverged group aborts with a clear error instead of silently producing inconsistent versions."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e397757-8ea8-4bb0-91d1-6a11a5c6eba7","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
