{"parentUuid":"effe2746-a2ed-4d2a-9f45-eb68e2bdc111","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BHQkh8J154YKBRYDyFxkmy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-graph: patch\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\t# Cascade correctness: peer-escalation severity and cross-ecosystem rewrite keys\n6\t\n7\t- Peer-dependency escalation now respects the actual cascading severity instead of always jumping to Major — a Patch-level upstream change no longer escalates a peer to Major just because the range fell out of coverage.\n8\t- Dependency-spec rewrite keys for a cross-ecosystem cascade are now built from the dependent's ecosystem-native identity instead of `PackageId::name()`, fixing a crash (`ManifestError::DependencyNotFound`) on an ordinary Cargo+npm co-located package.\n9\t"}]},"uuid":"7fa064a9-1859-450d-9b15-a20983ee603a","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:05:54.656Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/cascade-severity-fixes.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: patch\n---\n\n# Cascade correctness: peer-escalation severity and cross-ecosystem rewrite keys\n\n- Peer-dependency escalation now respects the actual cascading severity instead of always jumping to Major — a Patch-level upstream change no longer escalates a peer to Major just because the range fell out of coverage.\n- Dependency-spec rewrite keys for a cross-ecosystem cascade are now built from the dependent's ecosystem-native identity instead of `PackageId::name()`, fixing a crash (`ManifestError::DependencyNotFound`) on an ordinary Cargo+npm co-located package.\n","numLines":9,"startLine":1,"totalLines":9}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"effe2746-a2ed-4d2a-9f45-eb68e2bdc111","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","