{"parentUuid":"a2f3e306-0cb3-491c-810c-3daa010d310d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGjQyvH7hePvFjHPyViN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013GkJ6g3UUshrvVj7DVEu9A","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","content":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n**Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**\n\n- **Breaking:** JSON report fields renamed (visible via `callisto-cli --format json`) — `ValidateReport.valid` → `ok`; `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body` → `body`; `TagReport.created_tags` → `tags` (plus new `already_existed: bool`); `StatusReport` gained `hasChangesets`, `lastReleasedVersion`, `releaseTrigger`; `ReleaseEntry` gained a required `isPrerelease: bool` computed from the resolved version. Update anything parsing this JSON, including the shipped GitHub Action.\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha`: when a tag already exists at a different commit, it now resolves the real target via `git rev-parse` (both apply and `--dry-run` modes).\n- The shipped GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes (1 = pending, 2 = none pending) — the release-PR creation step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's GitHub Release creation loop now reads each release entry's `isPrerelease` field directly instead of guessing from the tag string (the old `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)` regex missed PEP 440 prereleases like `1.2.3a1` entirely), and hard-fails before creating a release if that field is missing or non-boolean rather than silently treating it as `false`.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back for each release instead of always leaving `changelogSection` blank.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":924,"cache_read_input_tokens":252135,"output_tokens":679,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":924,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":679,"cache_read_input_tokens":252135,"cache_creation_input_tokens":924,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":924},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGjQvNDKFcc9T9m4Yd6t","type":"assistant","uuid":"1f933cb4-757b-4e75-8ed1-e2f03c1d9da2","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:09.077Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
