{"parentUuid":"75f0c36c-b90e-4d74-a243-0846d6a73475","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y2qqf4wr7QU6C33iE2mXLM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-graph: minor\n3\tcallisto-manifests: minor\n4\tcallisto-model: minor\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t# Manifest writes are batched and more reliable\n8\t\n9\t## Breaking Changes\n10\t\n11\t- **`Manifest::persist` is now a required trait method.** `write_version`, `update_dependency_spec`, and `update_optional_dependencies` only mutate in memory now — call `persist()` to write. Custom `Manifest` implementors must add it.\n12\t\n13\t## Fixes\n14\t\n15\t- `apply_version_plan` is now idempotent, refreshes the npm lockfile, and persists writes correctly — previously risked a lost write.\n16\t- Manifest writes to the same physical file are now batched into one open/mutate/persist cycle, processed strictly in order, closing a stale-handle data-loss bug where two separate write mechanisms touching the same file could clobber each other.\n17\t"}]},"uuid":"4a49aa89-9db5-4afd-8760-4c3570930785","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:18.626Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/manifest-write-batching.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-manifests: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\n---\n\n# Manifest writes are batched and more reliable\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`Manifest::persist` is now a required trait method.** `write_version`, `update_dependency_spec`, and `update_optional_dependencies` only mutate in memory now — call `persist()` to write. Custom `Manifest` implementors must add it.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `apply_version_plan` is now idempotent, refreshes the npm lockfile, and persists writes correctly — previously risked a lost write.\n- Manifest writes to the same physical file are now batched into one open/mutate/persist cycle, processed strictly in order, closing a stale-handle data-loss bug where two separate write mechanisms touching the same file could clobber each other.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"75f0c36c-b90e-4d74-a243-0846d6a73475","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
