{"parentUuid":"8181e157-2f47-4d99-a7cf-9ca20c866ac2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016fQEZqaPRCFaDC6h1utV8b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-graph: minor\n3\tcallisto-model: minor\n4\tcallisto-manifests: patch\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t# npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum\n8\t\n9\t## Breaking Changes\n10\t\n11\t- **`PublishTarget::Npm.restricted: bool` → `access: Option<NpmAccess>`.** npm's `publishConfig.access` has three real states (unset, public, restricted); a bool couldn't hold them. An explicit `\"public\"` on an unscoped package was previously dropped silently.\n12\t\n13\t## Fixes\n14\t\n15\t- npm dist-tag, PyPI index, and Cargo registry selection are now threaded through the publish boundary consistently.\n16\t"}]},"uuid":"66d95a94-f3f6-4cbf-9e9b-00f9fa54ae32","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:23.274Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/publish-target-registry-modeling.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n# npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`PublishTarget::Npm.restricted: bool` → `access: Option<NpmAccess>`.** npm's `publishConfig.access` has three real states (unset, public, restricted); a bool couldn't hold them. An explicit `\"public\"` on an unscoped package was previously dropped silently.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- npm dist-tag, PyPI index, and Cargo registry selection are now threaded through the publish boundary consistently.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8181e157-2f47-4d99-a7cf-9ca20c866ac2","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
