{"parentUuid":"a5aa1250-6a6a-4173-96c9-bb194cf4f8f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGjSQURtLHfECgPDVP1w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015hUbf8k9GLvtgtAYwCTDth","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/publish-target-registry-modeling.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n**npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum**\n\n- **Breaking:** `PublishTarget::Npm.restricted: bool` → `access: Option<NpmAccess>`. npm's `publishConfig.access` has three real states (unset, public, restricted); a bool couldn't hold them. An explicit `\"public\"` on an unscoped package was previously dropped silently.\n- npm dist-tag, PyPI index, and Cargo registry selection are now threaded through the publish boundary consistently.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":256316,"output_tokens":301,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":301,"cache_read_input_tokens":256316,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGjSPSRGk5iGZS3Sf3ZD","type":"assistant","uuid":"b1412158-51e5-4771-aae5-605ef3343ac6","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:25.828Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBran