{"parentUuid":"bfea8040-d991-4f35-a647-13d823ee7938","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGjT1vdpn5d4DiPdy3ZN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AmcmuGQrQqnVtGo5bpSuLp","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**\n\n- Fixed-group siblings now bump to one shared target instead of drifting independently.\n- Group divergence and napi-drift checks are now actually enforced before a version is applied.\n- `ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected instead of silently accepted.\n- The workspace itself is declared as a `[[fixed-group]]`, with a regression test pinning that multiple changesets converge to one bump, not a compounded one.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":805,"cache_read_input_tokens":257862,"output_tokens":993,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":688},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":993,"cache_read_input_tokens":257862,"cache_creation_input_tokens":805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":805},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGjSzu7sALCzWqjPykh4","type":"assistant","uuid":"4f55f6c6-fd8c-4217-a3dd-b4a2a43f6a72","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:42.664Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"4f55f6c6-fd8c-4217-a3dd-b4a2a43f6a72","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AmcmuGQrQqnVtGo5bpSuLp","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"2fce9468-2153-4466-880b-e174fa99bec3","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:42.740Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**\n\n- Fixed-group siblings now bump to one shared target instead of drifting independently.\n- Group divergence and napi-drift checks are now actually enforced before a version is applied.\n- `ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected instead of silently accepted.\n- The workspace itself is declared as a `[[fixed-group]]`, with a regression test pinning that multiple changesets converge to one bump, not a compounded one.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," **Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**"," ","-- Siblings in a `[[fixed-group]]` now bump to one shared target instead of drifting to independent versions when multiple changesets in the group carry different severities.","-- `pre_mutation_checks` (divergence detection, napi-drift detection) is now actually wired into `plan_version`'s orchestration; a diverged group aborts with a clear error instead of silently producing inconsistent versions.","-- `GraphError::ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected: two differently-spelled group-member strings that resolve to the same package across two groups are caught instead of silently accepted.","-- The workspace itself is now declared as a `[[fixed-group]]` in `callisto.toml`, and a regression test pins that two independent changesets in one group converge to a single bump (e.g. two minor changesets converge to one minor bump, not a compounded double bump).","+- Fixed-group siblings now bump to one shared target instead of drifting independently.","+- Group divergence and napi-drift checks are now actually enforced before a version is applied.","+- `ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected instead of silently accepted.","+- The workspace itself is declared as a `[[fixed-group]]`, with a regression test pinning that multiple changesets converge to one bump, not a compounded one."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**\n\n- Siblings in a `[[fixed-group]]` now bump to one shared target instead of drifting to independent versions when multiple changesets in the group carry different severities.\n- `pre_mutation_checks` (divergence detection, napi-drift detection) is now actually wired into `plan_version`'s orchestration; a diverged group aborts with a clear error instead of silently producing inconsistent versions.\n- `GraphError::ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected: two differently-spelled group-member strings that resolve to the same package across two groups are caught instead of silently accepted.\n- The workspace itself is now declared as a `[[fixed-group]]` in `callisto.toml`, and a regression test pins that two independent changesets in one group converge to a single bump (e.g. two minor changesets converge to one minor bump, not a compounded double bump).\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4f55f6c6-fd8c-4217-a3dd-b4a2a43f6a72","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
