{"parentUuid":"938fe4da-27c7-4d93-bb48-9c3f3b66c29b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ndoea7kZ1iw1bvKiG78eV1","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/cascade-severity-fixes.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"0aa5208a-b429-45c1-b289-85c42d34c82f","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:45.460Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/cascade-severity-fixes.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: patch\n---\n\n**Cascade correctness: peer-escalation severity and cross-ecosystem rewrite keys**\n\n- Peer-dependency escalation now respects the real cascading severity instead of always jumping to Major.\n- Cross-ecosystem dependency rewrites now target the correct manifest key instead of crashing on dual-identity packages.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":5,"newStart":4,"newLines":5,"lines":[" "," **Cascade correctness: peer-escalation severity and cross-ecosystem rewrite keys**"," ","-- Peer-dependency escalation now respects the actual cascading severity instead of always jumping to Major — a Patch-level upstream change no longer escalates a peer to Major just because the range fell out of coverage.","-- Dependency-spec rewrite keys for a cross-ecosystem cascade are now built from the dependent's ecosystem-native identity instead of `PackageId::name()`, fixing a crash (`ManifestError::DependencyNotFound`) on an ordinary Cargo+npm co-located package.","+- Peer-dependency escalation now respects the real cascading severity instead of always jumping to Major.","+- Cross-ecosystem dependency rewrites now target the correct manifest key instead of crashing on dual-identity packages."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: patch\n---\n\n**Cascade correctness: peer-escalation severity and cross-ecosystem rewrite keys**\n\n- Peer-dependency escalation now respects the actual cascading severity instead of always jumping to Major — a Patch-level upstream change no longer escalates a peer to Major just because the range fell out of coverage.\n- Dependency-spec rewrite keys for a cross-ecosystem cascade are now built from the dependent's ecosystem-native identity instead of `PackageId::name()`, fixing a crash (`ManifestError::DependencyNotFound`) on an ordinary Cargo+npm co-located package.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"938fe4da-27c7-4d93-bb48-9c3f3b66c29b","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
