{"parentUuid":"6dd3e1ab-cc0b-425d-9ec6-b1fc8f838e6d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGjUFobDvNX1UbmJksNN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Bk1KMNDFYyPTz7TYpwP1wN","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","content":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n**Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**\n\n- **Breaking:** several JSON report fields renamed or added (`ValidateReport.valid`→`ok`, `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body`→`body`, `TagReport.created_tags`→`tags`, new `StatusReport`/`ReleaseEntry` fields) — update anything parsing this JSON.\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha` for a tag that already exists at a different commit.\n- The GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes — the release-PR step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's release-creation loop now reads `isPrerelease` per entry instead of guessing from the tag string, and hard-fails on a missing/invalid value.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back instead of always leaving it blank.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_read_input_tokens":260200,"output_tokens":450,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":260200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGjUEf8XCtGHR5i4cDqa","type":"assistant","uuid":"665903d7-19b9-484c-93a7-23a936afb6db","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:52.599Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"665903d7-19b9-484c-93a7-23a936afb6db","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bk1KMNDFYyPTz7TYpwP1wN","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"7f4d526d-1376-431b-bc37-fad06db18e13","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:06:52.666Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","content":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n**Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**\n\n- **Breaking:** several JSON report fields renamed or added (`ValidateReport.valid`→`ok`, `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body`→`body`, `TagReport.created_tags`→`tags`, new `StatusReport`/`ReleaseEntry` fields) — update anything parsing this JSON.\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha` for a tag that already exists at a different commit.\n- The GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes — the release-PR step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's release-creation loop now reads `isPrerelease` per entry instead of guessing from the tag string, and hard-fails on a missing/invalid value.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back instead of always leaving it blank.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":8,"newStart":7,"newLines":8,"lines":[" "," **Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**"," ","-- **Breaking:** JSON report fields renamed (visible via `callisto-cli --format json`) — `ValidateReport.valid` → `ok`; `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body` → `body`; `TagReport.created_tags` → `tags` (plus new `already_existed: bool`); `StatusReport` gained `hasChangesets`, `lastReleasedVersion`, `releaseTrigger`; `ReleaseEntry` gained a required `isPrerelease: bool` computed from the resolved version. Update anything parsing this JSON, including the shipped GitHub Action.","-- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha`: when a tag already exists at a different commit, it now resolves the real target via `git rev-parse` (both apply and `--dry-run` modes).","-- The shipped GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes (1 = pending, 2 = none pending) — the release-PR creation step was previously unreachable.","-- The GitHub Action's GitHub Release creation loop now reads each release entry's `isPrerelease` field directly instead of guessing from the tag string (the old `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)` regex missed PEP 440 prereleases like `1.2.3a1` entirely), and hard-fails before creating a release if that field is missing or non-boolean rather than silently treating it as `false`.","-- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back for each release instead of always leaving `changelogSection` blank.","+- **Breaking:** several JSON report fields renamed or added (`ValidateReport.valid`→`ok`, `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body`→`body`, `TagReport.created_tags`→`tags`, new `StatusReport`/`ReleaseEntry` fields) — update anything parsing this JSON.","+- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha` for a tag that already exists at a different commit.","+- The GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes — the release-PR step was previously unreachable.","+- The GitHub Action's release-creation loop now reads `isPrerelease` per entry instead of guessing from the tag string, and hard-fails on a missing/invalid value.","+- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back instead of always leaving it blank."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n**Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**\n\n- **Breaking:** JSON report fields renamed (visible via `callisto-cli --format json`) — `ValidateReport.valid` → `ok`; `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body` → `body`; `TagReport.created_tags` → `tags` (plus new `already_existed: bool`); `StatusReport` gained `hasChangesets`, `lastReleasedVersion`, `releaseTrigger`; `ReleaseEntry` gained a required `isPrerelease: bool` computed from the resolved version. Update anything parsing this JSON, including the shipped GitHub Action.\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha`: when a tag already exists at a different commit, it now resolves the real target via `git rev-parse` (both apply and `--dry-run` modes).\n- The shipped GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes (1 = pending, 2 = none pending) — the release-PR creation step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's GitHub Release creation loop now reads each release entry's `isPrerelease` field directly instead of guessing from the tag string (the old `-(alpha|beta|rc|pre|next)` regex missed PEP 440 prereleases like `1.2.3a1` entirely), and hard-fails before creating a release if that field is missing or non-boolean rather than silently treating it as `false`.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back for each release instead of always leaving `changelogSection` blank.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"665903d7-19b9-484c-93a7-23a936afb6db","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
