{"parentUuid":"90075bf3-a638-4839-aafc-854e4ea20dc9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UgJTMPZyopJNnLvHaRvfng","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"069674fd-0988-451d-80f7-f07060d55cc5","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:30.409Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/fixed-group-convergence.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**\n\n- Packages in a `[[fixed-group]]` now bump to the same version together, instead of drifting apart when they carry changesets of different severity.\n- A group that would end up in an inconsistent state now aborts with a clear error instead of silently shipping a broken version.\n- Two differently-spelled group-member entries that actually point to the same package are now caught as a config error instead of silently accepted.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4,"newLines":6,"lines":[" "," **Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**"," ","-- Fixed-group siblings now bump to one shared target instead of drifting independently.","-- Group divergence and napi-drift checks are now actually enforced before a version is applied.","-- `ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected instead of silently accepted.","-- The workspace itself is declared as a `[[fixed-group]]`, with a regression test pinning that multiple changesets converge to one bump, not a compounded one.","+- Packages in a `[[fixed-group]]` now bump to the same version together, instead of drifting apart when they carry changesets of different severity.","+- A group that would end up in an inconsistent state now aborts with a clear error instead of silently shipping a broken version.","+- Two differently-spelled group-member entries that actually point to the same package are now caught as a config error instead of silently accepted."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Fixed groups converge on a single, shared target version**\n\n- Fixed-group siblings now bump to one shared target instead of drifting independently.\n- Group divergence and napi-drift checks are now actually enforced before a version is applied.\n- `ConflictingGroupMembership` is now actually detected instead of silently accepted.\n- The workspace itself is declared as a `[[fixed-group]]`, with a regression test pinning that multiple changesets converge to one bump, not a compounded one.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"90075bf3-a638-4839-aafc-854e4ea20dc9","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
