{"parentUuid":"2c52eda1-5d4c-4bb3-a444-cc9df5c1e52b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BV8Aep1VxjVs4Q71zeDKvC","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/identity-ecosystem-resolution.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"2b85fe68-1ca7-4046-8839-4ca3020233b1","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:36.146Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/identity-ecosystem-resolution.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Better cross-ecosystem package discovery**\n\n- Packages excluded from your Cargo/npm/pnpm workspace (fuzz targets, scratch examples) no longer show up as release-managed.\n- A Rust crate and its same-named Python binding in one workspace no longer trigger a duplicate-package error.\n- `cargo:name`/`npm:name` prefixes in group config now work as documented.\n- A package name is no longer silently matched to the wrong ecosystem when the intended match is missing.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," **Better cross-ecosystem package discovery**"," ","-- Cargo/npm/pnpm workspace membership is now honored, so excluded packages (fuzz targets, scratch examples) no longer show up as release-managed.","-- Same-named packages in different ecosystems now resolve correctly instead of erroring.","-- `cargo:foo`/`npm:foo` ecosystem-prefixed group-member names now work.","-- A silent, incorrect cross-ecosystem identity fallback has been removed.","+- Packages excluded from your Cargo/npm/pnpm workspace (fuzz targets, scratch examples) no longer show up as release-managed.","+- A Rust crate and its same-named Python binding in one workspace no longer trigger a duplicate-package error.","+- `cargo:name`/`npm:name` prefixes in group config now work as documented.","+- A package name is no longer silently matched to the wrong ecosystem when the intended match is missing."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**Better cross-ecosystem package discovery**\n\n- Cargo/npm/pnpm workspace membership is now honored, so excluded packages (fuzz targets, scratch examples) no longer show up as release-managed.\n- Same-named packages in different ecosystems now resolve correctly instead of erroring.\n- `cargo:foo`/`npm:foo` ecosystem-prefixed group-member names now work.\n- A silent, incorrect cross-ecosystem identity fallback has been removed.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2c52eda1-5d4c-4bb3-a444-cc9df5c1e52b","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
