{"parentUuid":"2ba9ef61-5820-43b8-b9d4-885372ecab8b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TiiuKEZWFpjp4H8xR83un4","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"a7918216-6865-4c57-9920-e45c962945fa","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:40.118Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/release-pipeline-contract.md","content":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n**Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**\n\n- **Breaking:** several `--format json` field names changed or were added (`validate`, `compose-pr-body`, `tag`, `status`, `plan-publish`) — update any scripts parsing this output.\n- Re-tagging a release that already exists no longer reports the wrong commit sha.\n- The official GitHub Action now actually opens a release PR when changesets are pending — a bug made this step unreachable before.\n- GitHub Releases are now correctly marked prerelease for PEP 440 versions too (e.g. `1.2.3a1`), not just SemVer's `-` syntax.\n- Release notes now include the real changelog section instead of nothing.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":8,"newStart":7,"newLines":8,"lines":[" "," **Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**"," ","-- **Breaking:** several JSON report fields renamed or added (`ValidateReport.valid`→`ok`, `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body`→`body`, `TagReport.created_tags`→`tags`, new `StatusReport`/`ReleaseEntry` fields) — update anything parsing this JSON.","-- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha` for a tag that already exists at a different commit.","-- The GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes — the release-PR step was previously unreachable.","-- The GitHub Action's release-creation loop now reads `isPrerelease` per entry instead of guessing from the tag string, and hard-fails on a missing/invalid value.","-- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back instead of always leaving it blank.","+- **Breaking:** several `--format json` field names changed or were added (`validate`, `compose-pr-body`, `tag`, `status`, `plan-publish`) — update any scripts parsing this output.","+- Re-tagging a release that already exists no longer reports the wrong commit sha.","+- The official GitHub Action now actually opens a release PR when changesets are pending — a bug made this step unreachable before.","+- GitHub Releases are now correctly marked prerelease for PEP 440 versions too (e.g. `1.2.3a1`), not just SemVer's `-` syntax.","+- Release notes now include the real changelog section instead of nothing."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-cli: minor\ncallisto-moon: patch\n---\n\n**Release-pipeline / CI Action contract correctness**\n\n- **Breaking:** several JSON report fields renamed or added (`ValidateReport.valid`→`ok`, `ComposePrBodyReport.pr_body`→`body`, `TagReport.created_tags`→`tags`, new `StatusReport`/`ReleaseEntry` fields) — update anything parsing this JSON.\n- `callisto tag` no longer fabricates a `sha` for a tag that already exists at a different commit.\n- The GitHub Action's `status --check` branching now matches the CLI's real exit codes — the release-PR step was previously unreachable.\n- The GitHub Action's release-creation loop now reads `isPrerelease` per entry instead of guessing from the tag string, and hard-fails on a missing/invalid value.\n- `plan_publish` now reads the real `CHANGELOG.md` section back instead of always leaving it blank.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2ba9ef61-5820-43b8-b9d4-885372ecab8b","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
