{"parentUuid":"86287a88-23a4-44b9-8739-c4a98abd1a17","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGjY5XpTykpijT1jqXk3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NjAwm2ZR3XAM61UsaMikkK","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/changelog-pr-body-rendering.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**One changelog renderer, everywhere**\n\n- PR descriptions and `CHANGELOG.md` entries are now generated by the same logic, so they no longer disagree.\n- Bumps inferred from commit messages, and packages newly added to a group, now get a real changelog entry instead of a placeholder.\n- If several changes caused one package's bump, the changelog now lists all of them, not just one.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":534,"cache_read_input_tokens":266040,"output_tokens":244,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":534,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":244,"cache_read_input_tokens":266040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":534,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":534},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGjY4VZCKU3QUi3SAgLL","type":"assistant","uuid":"7442c412-7664-455c-aadc-2b1cdeb4ee32","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:43.003Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"7442c412-7664-455c-aadc-2b1cdeb4ee32","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NjAwm2ZR3XAM61UsaMikkK","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/changelog-pr-body-rendering.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"99fd17f9-cf9d-44ce-8bbb-b7fe36f465eb","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:43.075Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/changelog-pr-body-rendering.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**One changelog renderer, everywhere**\n\n- PR descriptions and `CHANGELOG.md` entries are now generated by the same logic, so they no longer disagree.\n- Bumps inferred from commit messages, and packages newly added to a group, now get a real changelog entry instead of a placeholder.\n- If several changes caused one package's bump, the changelog now lists all of them, not just one.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":6,"newStart":4,"newLines":6,"lines":[" "," **One changelog renderer, everywhere**"," ","-- PR bodies now render through the same code `CHANGELOG.md` uses, instead of a separate hand-rolled path.","-- Inference-driven bumps and fixed-group new-member joins now get real changelog entries instead of a placeholder.","-- A bump with multiple contributing causes now lists all of them, not just one.","+- PR descriptions and `CHANGELOG.md` entries are now generated by the same logic, so they no longer disagree.","+- Bumps inferred from commit messages, and packages newly added to a group, now get a real changelog entry instead of a placeholder.","+- If several changes caused one package's bump, the changelog now lists all of them, not just one."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\n---\n\n**One changelog renderer, everywhere**\n\n- PR bodies now render through the same code `CHANGELOG.md` uses, instead of a separate hand-rolled path.\n- Inference-driven bumps and fixed-group new-member joins now get real changelog entries instead of a placeholder.\n- A bump with multiple contributing causes now lists all of them, not just one.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7442c412-7664-455c-aadc-2b1cdeb4ee32","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
