{"parentUuid":"99c1b741-12e5-49ad-907b-844249cf8f9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeGjYo786omgzGyiK6d2j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FzYXcyNiUxS36mmvUQg43r","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/publish-target-registry-modeling.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n**npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum**\n\n- **Breaking:** npm publish config's `restricted: bool` option is replaced by `access` (`\"public\"`/`\"restricted\"`, matching npm's own options) — update your `callisto.toml`.\n- Publishing an unscoped package with `access: \"public\"` no longer silently drops that setting.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":417,"cache_read_input_tokens":267404,"output_tokens":252,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":417,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":252,"cache_read_input_tokens":267404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":417,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":417},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeGjYmrTwwCSaaERoa8HT","type":"assistant","uuid":"b45f0e20-e350-4e58-9f22-5538e0d48fac","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:52.987Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"b45f0e20-e350-4e58-9f22-5538e0d48fac","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzYXcyNiUxS36mmvUQg43r","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/publish-target-registry-modeling.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"31f149d7-4bb8-479e-875f-c994bcad66ec","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:07:53.057Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/publish-target-registry-modeling.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n**npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum**\n\n- **Breaking:** npm publish config's `restricted: bool` option is replaced by `access` (`\"public\"`/`\"restricted\"`, matching npm's own options) — update your `callisto.toml`.\n- Publishing an unscoped package with `access: \"public\"` no longer silently drops that setting.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":5,"newStart":6,"newLines":5,"lines":[" "," **npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum**"," ","-- **Breaking:** `PublishTarget::Npm.restricted: bool` → `access: Option<NpmAccess>`. npm's `publishConfig.access` has three real states (unset, public, restricted); a bool couldn't hold them. An explicit `\"public\"` on an unscoped package was previously dropped silently.","-- npm dist-tag, PyPI index, and Cargo registry selection are now threaded through the publish boundary consistently.","+- **Breaking:** npm publish config's `restricted: bool` option is replaced by `access` (`\"public\"`/`\"restricted\"`, matching npm's own options) — update your `callisto.toml`.","+- Publishing an unscoped package with `access: \"public\"` no longer silently drops that setting."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n**npm publish access modeled as a 3-state enum**\n\n- **Breaking:** `PublishTarget::Npm.restricted: bool` → `access: Option<NpmAccess>`. npm's `publishConfig.access` has three real states (unset, public, restricted); a bool couldn't hold them. An explicit `\"public\"` on an unscoped package was previously dropped silently.\n- npm dist-tag, PyPI index, and Cargo registry selection are now threaded through the publish boundary consistently.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b45f0e20-e350-4e58-9f22-5538e0d48fac","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
