led as a 3-state enum**\n\n- **Breaking:** npm publish config's `restricted: bool` option is replaced by `access` (`\"public\"`/`\"restricted\"`, matching npm's own options) — update your `callisto.toml`.\n- Publishing an unscoped package with `access: \"public\"` no longer silently drops that setting.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"578d4bb0-e29f-4a83-b4b6-2b04e7aa1fe4","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
