{"parentUuid":"e3d18534-4443-4a6e-a698-62840ef14cee","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011EKprkzrw2H3wkuMuBSebR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-conventional: minor\n3\tcallisto-vcs: patch\n4\tcallisto-graph: patch\n5\tcallisto-model: patch\n6\tcallisto-format: patch\n7\tcallisto-manifests: patch\n8\t---\n9\t\n10\t# Git-access layer decoupling, performance, and small correctness fixes\n11\t\n12\t## Breaking Changes\n13\t\n14\t- **`callisto-conventional` no longer depends on `callisto-vcs`.** `fetch_commits`/`infer_severity` now take `&dyn callisto_model::CommitWalker`; `ConventionalError::Vcs` renamed to `ConventionalError::CommitWalk`.\n15\t\n16\t## Fixes\n17\t\n18\t- `BREAKING CHANGE:` commit-footer parsing fixed (`callisto-conventional`).\n19\t- Merged-branch commits crossing the `since` boundary are no longer dropped from `commits_since_with_pathspec` (`callisto-vcs`).\n20\t- Caret-range coverage (`caret_covers`) now correctly excludes pre-release versions — `^1.2.3` no longer incorrectly covers `1.9.0-alpha.1` (`callisto-graph`).\n21\t- Cargo compound dependency-range rewriting now stays within the upper bound (`callisto-manifests`).\n22\t- PEP 440 `is_prerelease`/`VersionReq` normalization fixed (`callisto-model`).\n23\t- Python dependency-name matching now applies PEP 503 normalization (`callisto-model`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-graph`).\n24\t- npm workspace package-manager (pnpm/yarn/bun/npm) is now auto-detected for publish (`callisto-graph`).\n25\t- Several duplicate diagnostic codes — different errors that previously shared one code — now have their own (`callisto-model`, `callisto-format`, `callisto-graph`).\n26\t\n27\t## Performance\n28\t\n29\t- `status`, `plan_snapshot`, `plan_publish`, and `plan_version` now share one `GitAccess` instead of rediscovering the repository per package or command (`callisto-graph`).\n30\t- Tag existence checks now use the cached `TagIndex` instead of a lookup per release (`callisto-graph`).\n31\t"}]},"uuid":"824d24e9-2207-4485-85f2-c8cede26b8a2","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:08:17.815Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/git-layer-and-misc-fixes.md","content":"---\ncallisto-conventional: minor\ncallisto-vcs: patch\ncallisto-graph: patch\ncallisto-model: patch\ncallisto-format: patch\ncallisto-manifests: patch\n---\n\n# Git-access layer decoupling, performance, and small correctness fixes\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- **`callisto-conventional` no longer depends on `callisto-vcs`.** `fetch_commits`/`infer_severity` now take `&dyn callisto_model::CommitWalker`; `ConventionalError::Vcs` renamed to `ConventionalError::CommitWalk`.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- `BREAKING CHANGE:` commit-footer parsing fixed (`callisto-conventional`).\n- Merged-branch commits crossing the `since` boundary are no longer dropped from `commits_since_with_pathspec` (`callisto-vcs`).\n- Caret-range coverage (`caret_covers`) now correctly excludes pre-release versions — `^1.2.3` no longer incorrectly covers `1.9.0-alpha.1` (`callisto-graph`).\n- Cargo compound dependency-range rewriting now stays within the upper bound (`callisto-manifests`).\n- PEP 440 `is_prerelease`/`VersionReq` normalization fixed (`callisto-model`).\n- Python dependency-name matching now applies PEP 503 normalization (`callisto-model`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-graph`).\n- npm workspace package-manager (pnpm/yarn/bun/npm) is now auto-detected for publish (`callisto-graph`).\n- Several duplicate diagnostic codes — different errors that previously shared one code — now have their own (`callisto-model`, `callisto-format`, `callisto-graph`).\n\n## Performance\n\n- `status`, `plan_snapshot`, `plan_publish`, and `plan_version` now share one `GitAccess` instead of rediscovering the repository per package or command (`callisto-graph`).\n- Tag existence checks now use the cached `TagIndex` instead of a lookup per release (`callisto-graph`).\n","numLines":31,"startLine":1,"totalLines":31}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e3d18534-4443-4a6e-a698-62840ef14cee","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
