{"parentUuid":"eb1d37fb-f86f-434a-94cc-6e1fbe26d410","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e877a5a9-a850-4545-ae4f-100d7e4ceb26","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YNuDZiaNmNkcN6GSJUigzN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-graph: minor\n3\tcallisto-manifests: minor\n4\tcallisto-model: minor\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t**Manifest writes are batched and more reliable**\n8\t\n9\t- **Breaking (custom manifest integrations only):** implementing callisto's `Manifest` trait now requires a `persist()` method to actually write your changes.\n10\t- Re-running a version bump is now safe and won't risk losing a write.\n11\t- Multiple changes to the same manifest file in one run are now applied together instead of risking one overwriting another.\n12\t"}]},"uuid":"adbc165e-300c-4b79-ba92-955426a59126","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:08:24.949Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.changeset/manifest-write-batching.md","content":"---\ncallisto-graph: minor\ncallisto-manifests: minor\ncallisto-model: minor\n---\n\n**Manifest writes are batched and more reliable**\n\n- **Breaking (custom manifest integrations only):** implementing callisto's `Manifest` trait now requires a `persist()` method to actually write your changes.\n- Re-running a version bump is now safe and won't risk losing a write.\n- Multiple changes to the same manifest file in one run are now applied together instead of risking one overwriting another.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eb1d37fb-f86f-434a-94cc-6e1fbe26d410","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
