{"parentUuid":"844f280f-adae-4fed-ab7a-8fa3f5a7228e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeH2vSagzgvNvz88hEdRN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":354282,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1919,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1444},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":354282,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1919,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":354282,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":354282},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CeH2vQzwQTu19Mx8NZcP9","type":"assistant","uuid":"abc0089d-9931-4f1c-828c-441fdf31450b","timestamp":"2026-08-22T02:56:03.415Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"abc0089d-9931-4f1c-828c-441fdf31450b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeH2vSagzgvNvz88hEdRN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agreed — once the reader knows the version went `0.3.3 → 0.4.0`, they already know it's a minor release. Sub-splitting by each entry's *original* authored severity doesn't tell them anything they need; it's bookkeeping metadata leaking into a document meant for \"what's new.\" Flattening to one list per version is the right call.\n\nOne thing worth flagging before I touch it: `docs/00-design.md` §6.1 explicitly declares this Major/Minor/Patch sub-grouping \"byte-compatible with `@changesets/cli`'s own model\" — so this is a deliberate design decision I'd be reversing, not a bug I'd be fixing. It's still the right call given your reasoning, I just want to be clear I'm changing a documented convention, not restoring one.\n\nConcretely, that means editing `render_section` in `crates/callisto-changelog/src/render.rs` to emit one flat bullet list per version (dropping the `### Major/Minor/Patch Changes` sub-headings entirely), and dropping the `ChangeSource::GroupUnion` synthetic \"released together with the fixed group\" line — with no severity buckets, there's nothing left for it to explain. I'd also need to update the doc, the existing golden-file tests in `write.rs`/`render.rs` that currently assert on those headings, and confirm nothing else (PR body composer, schema) depends on the sub-heading structure.\n\nWant me to go ahead with that?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":354282,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1919,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1444},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":354282,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1919,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":354282,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":354282},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CeH2vQzwQTu19Mx8NZcP9","type":"assistant","uuid":"18816371-3616-483d-91b5-f9c10c508afb","timestamp":"2026-08-22T02:56:08.054Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"release-pipeline-and-matrix-hardening","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
