{"parentUuid":"458ea185-9491-4411-990b-ac309b96c8cf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJ7ib6Qq2aagVFa5iih7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2303,"cache_read_input_tokens":455626,"output_tokens":1020,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":387},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2303,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":455626,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2303},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJ7iZUvEGWARszRvHxdy","type":"assistant","uuid":"441bb4c0-c5f3-45d2-bc1e-92178eba5f31","timestamp":"2026-08-22T16:39:14.126Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"flatten-changelog-severity-grouping","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"441bb4c0-c5f3-45d2-bc1e-92178eba5f31","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJ7ib6Qq2aagVFa5iih7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed — this is Cargo-specific, not something that plays out the same way for npm/PyPI:\n\n- **Cargo**: `cargo publish` (run without `--no-verify`, confirmed in the code) does a real local verification step — it re-extracts the packaged tarball into a temp dir and does a genuine `cargo build`/test compile there, which needs *every* dependency in `Cargo.toml`, including `[dev-dependencies]`, resolvable from the registry. That's exactly the mechanism that broke.\n- **npm**: the code calls `npm publish` directly on the package directory (`publish_client.rs:422-423`) — no install/build/verification step in between. npm just tars up the files and uploads. `devDependencies` are never resolved from the registry as part of publish.\n- **PyPI**: `twine upload --skip-existing <pattern>` (`publish_client.rs:572`) only uploads already-built wheel/sdist files — twine doesn't build or resolve anything at all.\n\nSo neither npm nor PyPI packages managed by callisto would hit this specific failure mode today, since neither of those publish commands does Cargo's \"rebuild from a fresh registry resolve\" step. The bug is narrowly a consequence of Cargo's own default verification behavior colliding with dev-dependency edges being excluded from publish ordering.\n\nNow implementing the actual fix — `toposort_impl` is only ever called from `plan_publish` (confirmed, single call site), so I can safely widen its edge filter to include `DepKind::Dev` without touching cascade/version-bump semantics at all."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2303,"cache_read_input_tokens":455626,"output_tokens":1020,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":387},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2303,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":455626,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2303},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJ7iZUvEGWARszRvHxdy","type":"assistant","uuid":"15a2d3af-6ca7-4d8d-881f-13c70b89fbc1","timestamp":"2026-08-22T16:39:19.641Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"flatten-changelog-severity-grouping","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
