{"parentUuid":"353b0fb8-9779-42b9-aa6b-f5deb7d151e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJ9voU7R4Jz8roXocS32","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":111,"cache_read_input_tokens":494164,"output_tokens":8380,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":7671},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":111,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":8380,"cache_read_input_tokens":494164,"cache_creation_input_tokens":111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":111},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJ9vjpLw19fYYLAsonqi","type":"assistant","uuid":"e8eaf6f9-4e0e-49d8-a55d-ab695faf9ba0","timestamp":"2026-08-22T17:09:35.125Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"flatten-changelog-severity-grouping","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"e8eaf6f9-4e0e-49d8-a55d-ab695faf9ba0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJ9voU7R4Jz8roXocS32","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Thought through the sequencing carefully, since there's a real trap here beyond just \"fix the bug and retry.\"\n\n**The trap:** merging the ordering fix to `main` *with its own changeset* would make `status --check` report \"pending changesets\" again. The release Action would then take the \"create/update version-packages PR\" branch instead of the \"publish\" branch — blocking completion of the *already-decided* 0.4.0 release until that new changeset also goes through its own version cycle. Worse, if that next cycle bumps to 0.4.1 or 0.5.0, the four still-stuck crates (`conventional`, `graph`, `cli`, `moon`) would jump straight from `0.3.3` to that *later* version, permanently skipping `0.4.0` — while the other five sit at `0.4.0` forever. That makes today's inconsistency worse, not resolved.\n\n**The clean sequence:**\n1. Finish and verify the ordering fix (in progress).\n2. Skip a changeset for it — it's genuinely internal (only the unused, never-externally-called `DependencyResolverExt::toposort()` is removed; nothing about any published crate's actual behavior changes). No changeset means merging it to `main` adds zero new pending changesets.\n3. Merge the fix. `main` still has all nine `Cargo.toml`s at `0.4.0` and zero pending changesets (PR #6 already consumed the batch), so `status --check` still reports \"none pending.\"\n4. Re-trigger the release workflow. It takes the *publish* branch (not the version-PR branch), using the now-fixed ordering — completing `conventional`, `graph`, `cli`, `moon` at `0.4.0`, while the already-published five get a harmless \"already published\" response (already handled as a non-error case, confirmed in `publish_client.rs`'s test suite).\n5. *Only after* 0.4.0 is fully consistent across all nine, merge PR #7 (the changelog flatten fix, which does carry a real changeset) — its changeset then correctly seeds the next, clean release cycle instead of colliding with this one.\n\nWant me to proceed on that basis once the ordering fix is done and verified?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":111,"cache_read_input_tokens":494164,"output_tokens":8380,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":7671},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":111,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":8380,"cache_read_input_tokens":494164,"cache_creation_input_tokens":111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":111},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJ9vjpLw19fYYLAsonqi","type":"assistant","uuid":"abd0c35f-8fe1-447d-a60e-b4d6caf363ab","timestamp":"2026-08-22T17:09:42.200Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"flatten-changelog-severity-grouping","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
