{"parentUuid":"5115b342-5f40-494e-8023-2041ec52ae8e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJBERPwH2Cv55mcJHJK1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":504310,"output_tokens":1700,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1249},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1700,"cache_read_input_tokens":504310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJBEQCG1GxknjPVhT72Q","type":"assistant","uuid":"12e1aff8-b206-4378-838e-c993301388d7","timestamp":"2026-08-22T17:25:30.796Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"flatten-changelog-severity-grouping","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"12e1aff8-b206-4378-838e-c993301388d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJBERPwH2Cv55mcJHJK1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd recommend against a local publish here — using the GitHub Action instead:\n\n- **Credentials**: a local publish needs a real crates.io API token in this session's environment. That's a highly privileged credential (can publish/yank packages under your identity), and I don't have it and shouldn't be handling it directly — the Action already has `CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN` wired as a repo secret, scoped to CI only.\n- **Audit trail**: the first five crates were published via the Action's logs, which is now the historical record of what happened and when. A local publish would happen outside that trail, splitting the story of \"how 0.4.0 actually went out\" across two different mechanisms.\n- **It's also unnecessary**: `main`'s tree already has every `Cargo.toml` at `0.4.0` with zero pending changesets. Once the ordering fix is merged (with no changeset, per the sequencing plan), the *same* Action, re-triggered, will correctly skip the five already-published crates (their \"already exists\" response is already handled as a non-error, confirmed in `publish_client.rs`'s tests) and publish the remaining four — no local credentials, no manual `cargo publish` commands, no new execution path to reason about.\n\nSo: same mechanism that did the first five, just re-run after the fix lands. Want me to continue with implementing the actual ordering fix now, so we can get to that point?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":504310,"output_tokens":1700,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1249},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1700,"cache_read_input_tokens":504310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJBEQCG1GxknjPVhT72Q","type":"assistant","uuid":"12a67e53-179d-4f19-9de8-a136171512ee","timestamp":"2026-08-22T17:25:35.222Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"flatten-changelog-severity-grouping","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
