{"parentUuid":"80979bf1-fc85-439d-aafe-ecd190657008","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJDBApyyJQiqsRcUEHuG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":751,"cache_read_input_tokens":538861,"output_tokens":2619,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2012},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":751,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2619,"cache_read_input_tokens":538861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":751,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":751},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJDB9T8uGfZcwVNQhRpc","type":"assistant","uuid":"c16d5edb-9ba5-485b-afd5-7e4ee9d111ec","timestamp":"2026-08-22T17:51:02.778Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"fix-publish-order-dev-deps","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"c16d5edb-9ba5-485b-afd5-7e4ee9d111ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJDBApyyJQiqsRcUEHuG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, fair callout — that last doc comment was a wall of text. Looking back at it, it had run-on justifications, restated obvious things, and process narration (\"rather than a generic `DependencyResolverExt::toposort()`...\") that belongs in the PR description, not the code. Here's a much tighter version:\n\n```rust\n/// Cascade/version-bump propagation's ordering constraints — a `Dev`-only\n/// change must not force a consumer's version to bump.\nconst CASCADE_ORDERING_KINDS: &[DepKind] = &[DepKind::Runtime, DepKind::Build, DepKind::Optional];\n\n/// Publish ordering's constraints. Includes `Dev`: `cargo publish` (no\n/// `--no-verify`) rebuilds the packaged tarball, which needs dev-deps\n/// resolvable from the registry too.\nconst PUBLISH_ORDERING_KINDS: &[DepKind] =\n    &[DepKind::Runtime, DepKind::Build, DepKind::Optional, DepKind::Dev];\n\n/// Publish-specific ordering (see `plan_publish`, its only caller).\n///\n/// Prefers `Dev`-inclusive ordering; falls back to cascade's kinds on a\n/// cycle, since mutual dev-only deps between packages are legitimate and\n/// must not hard-fail the whole plan.\nfn publish_order<D: DependencyResolver + ?Sized>(\n    resolver: &D,\n    subset: &HashSet<PackageId>,\n) -> Result<Vec<PackageId>, GraphError> {\n    ...\n}\n```\n\nSame information, about a third the length. Want me to apply this, and should I sweep the rest of this session's other doc comments (the `toposort_impl` one, the changeset files, etc.) for the same tightening?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":751,"cache_read_input_tokens":538861,"output_tokens":2619,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2012},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":751,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2619,"cache_read_input_tokens":538861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":751,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":751},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJDB9T8uGfZcwVNQhRpc","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a0880af-c9f3-4a47-963a-b7fe86f0e1fe","timestamp":"2026-08-22T17:51:06.972Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"fix-publish-order-dev-deps","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
