{"parentUuid":"79dec5b2-22b6-439f-b518-c20b948f54a4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJFLNgrPm2ToXvpeZ3sM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The push is running the pre-push lint hook across all crates (will take a while, real work in progress). While that runs, let me lay out a plan for the doc cleanup given the scale involved.\n\n`docs/00-design.md` and `docs/01-spec.md` are large, formal spec documents (SPEC DECISION annotations, AC-XXX cross-references throughout) — not casual prose. A blind \"make it shorter\" pass risks losing precision that's there for a reason (resolving ambiguity, citing exact locations) or breaking cross-references. I'd rather scope this in phases:\n\n1. **CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / README.md** — small, low-risk, I'll just do this directly.\n2. **Rust `///` doc comments across the 10 crates** — medium-sized, docs-only diffs, low risk (no behavior change). I can sweep this crate-by-crate directly.\n3. **`docs/00-design.md` / `docs/01-spec.md`** — higher risk given the size and how load-bearing they are. I'd rather first produce a concrete list of genuinely bloated passages (not just \"long\" ones — length that's doing real work isn't the problem) for you to sign off on before editing, rather than rewriting thousands of lines unsupervised.\n\nWant me to proceed in that order — starting with 1 and 2 now, and bringing you a candidate list for 3 before touching it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2216,"cache_read_input_tokens":566628,"output_tokens":533,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":76},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2216,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":533,"cache_read_input_tokens":566628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2216,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2216},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJFLMBp4XUgDeNEDVKPU","type":"assistant","uuid":"e9949675-6318-4296-a05e-fd02ae9bc5b3","timestamp":"2026-08-22T18:19:09.189Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"rustfmt-max-width-120","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
