{"parentUuid":"b38d7233-c654-4ef9-9435-05a898704ad4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJFkhBm57Z5PqmUgWCyB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1273,"cache_read_input_tokens":582170,"output_tokens":1122,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":712},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1273,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1122,"cache_read_input_tokens":582170,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1273},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJFkfoumAjkcdfRFNsE9","type":"assistant","uuid":"da133de8-22dd-4cb8-95c2-3fb41d0428d3","timestamp":"2026-08-22T18:24:42.356Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"rustfmt-max-width-120","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"da133de8-22dd-4cb8-95c2-3fb41d0428d3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJFkhBm57Z5PqmUgWCyB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` needed only small tightening (done — cut filler phrasing, one redundant bullet, a repeated clause). `README.md`'s structure (tables, scannable blockquotes, concrete examples) is already good — but I found something more serious than wordiness while checking it:\n\n- **The WASM plugin install snippet points at `v0.1.0`** (`.moon/workspace.yml` example), while the repo is actually at `0.4.0` — stale.\n- **The \"sub-10ms\", \"30x to 50x faster than `@changesets/cli`\", and \"300-500ms Node.js startup cost\" claims have zero supporting evidence anywhere in the repo** — no `benches/` directory, nothing in `docs/*.md`. This is the *same file* that already had one fabricated-content incident fixed before (commit `7d0a658e`, \"fix stale license table entry and fabricated quick-start output\") — so this isn't a new pattern, it's a recurrence.\n\nThose are factual-accuracy problems, not wordiness ones, so I didn't touch them — want me to soften/remove the unverified performance claims and fix the version string, or do you actually have benchmark numbers backing them that I should ask you for instead?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1273,"cache_read_input_tokens":582170,"output_tokens":1122,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":712},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1273,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1122,"cache_read_input_tokens":582170,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1273},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeJFkfoumAjkcdfRFNsE9","type":"assistant","uuid":"4a5dc90b-f838-4c2e-a2c8-b1aadb99a62a","timestamp":"2026-08-22T18:24:46.312Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"rustfmt-max-width-120","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
