{"parentUuid":"ce19e541-692d-46a2-af73-f672b2f6968b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17f8931c-2c00-4d04-b776-0d3ff9f043f2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xxqy3iKQcevwPAx6Uicdo8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tuse globset::{GlobBuilder, GlobSet, GlobSetBuilder};\n2\tuse std::path::Path;\n3\t\n4\t/// Builds a [`GlobSet`] from a list of glob strings, matched with\n5\t/// `literal_separator(true)` semantics (`*` does not cross `/`; `**` does)\n6\t/// against forward-slash-normalized, workspace-relative paths.\n7\t///\n8\t/// Per-entry glob-compile-failure rule: an entry that fails to compile is\n9\t/// skipped and treated as never-matching; every other syntactically valid\n10\t/// entry in the same list is still compiled and matched normally. Never\n11\t/// panics, never returns an error.\n12\tpub(crate) fn build_globset(entries: &[String]) -> GlobSet {\n13\t    let mut builder = GlobSetBuilder::new();\n14\t    for entry in entries {\n15\t        if let Ok(glob) = GlobBuilder::new(entry).literal_separator(true).build() {\n16\t            builder.add(glob);\n17\t        }\n18\t    }"}]},"uuid":"2718764d-f39e-4fa6-9460-133e040e4c7e","timestamp":"2026-08-23T00:54:03.040Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs","content":"use globset::{GlobBuilder, GlobSet, GlobSetBuilder};\nuse std::path::Path;\n\n/// Builds a [`GlobSet`] from a list of glob strings, matched with\n/// `literal_separator(true)` semantics (`*` does not cross `/`; `**` does)\n/// against forward-slash-normalized, workspace-relative paths.\n///\n/// Per-entry glob-compile-failure rule: an entry that fails to compile is\n/// skipped and treated as never-matching; every other syntactically valid\n/// entry in the same list is still compiled and matched normally. Never\n/// panics, never returns an error.\npub(crate) fn build_globset(entries: &[String]) -> GlobSet {\n    let mut builder = GlobSetBuilder::new();\n    for entry in entries {\n        if let Ok(glob) = GlobBuilder::new(entry).literal_separator(true).build() {\n            builder.add(glob);\n        }\n    }","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":716}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ce19e541-692d-46a2-af73-f672b2f6968b","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
