{"parentUuid":"a0c494d8-bba5-4e8f-89e3-372eca7a33b7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17f8931c-2c00-4d04-b776-0d3ff9f043f2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y2GWXKTnmG3QTuptDDLqLc","type":"tool_result","content":"13\t\n14\t/// Fetches the full, unfiltered list of every tag name in the repository at\n15\t/// `root`, via [`GitAccess`] (native gix, falling back to a `CommandRunner`-\n16\t/// shelled `git tag --list` when gix is unavailable -- most notably on\n17\t/// `wasm32`).\n18\t///\n19\t/// Deliberately fetches with no glob pattern: callers filter afterwards\n20\t/// via [`matching_tags`], using the same `globset` matcher both\n21\t/// `GitDataSource` backends use internally -- identical tag-selection\n22\t/// semantics regardless of backend, and lets the fetch batch once across\n23\t/// every package (see [`TagIndex::build`]) instead of once per package,\n24\t/// important on `wasm32` where each `CommandRunner` call is a full Extism\n25\t/// round-trip.\n26\tfn fetch_all_tags(git: &GitAccess<'_>) -> Result<Vec<String>, GraphError> {"}]},"uuid":"5dcc7f36-e8a1-4d38-819d-8d4840d811a4","timestamp":"2026-08-23T00:54:46.574Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/tags.rs","content":"\n/// Fetches the full, unfiltered list of every tag name in the repository at\n/// `root`, via [`GitAccess`] (native gix, falling back to a `CommandRunner`-\n/// shelled `git tag --list` when gix is unavailable -- most notably on\n/// `wasm32`).\n///\n/// Deliberately fetches with no glob pattern: callers filter afterwards\n/// via [`matching_tags`], using the same `globset` matcher both\n/// `GitDataSource` backends use internally -- identical tag-selection\n/// semantics regardless of backend, and lets the fetch batch once across\n/// every package (see [`TagIndex::build`]) instead of once per package,\n/// important on `wasm32` where each `CommandRunner` call is a full Extism\n/// round-trip.\nfn fetch_all_tags(git: &GitAccess<'_>) -> Result<Vec<String>, GraphError> {","numLines":14,"startLine":13,"totalLines":621}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a0c494d8-bba5-4e8f-89e3-372eca7a33b7","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
