{"parentUuid":"742f8269-8723-406b-8d1c-4723989e781f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJr6pWZ9jFVknzHLYHLw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SskXYonfXpRf4DZy7EDHsb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngh pr create --title \"docs: tighten workspace doc comments (Rust /// blocks)\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\nComment-wordiness sweep across all 10 crates, matching the same guideline applied to `AGENTS.md`/`README.md` and the rustfmt width bump: succinct, precise, scannable -- cut restated framing, process narration, and duplicate content, kept genuinely dense/precise blocks (bullet lists, security tradeoffs, ASCII diagrams, spec-citation test docs) as-is.\n\n## Also fixed a real bug, not just wordiness\n`cascade.rs`'s diamond-dependency test carried an orphaned first paragraph about pinned pre-release baselines that had nothing to do with it -- it belonged to `test_bump_target_uses_pinned_pre_baseline_not_current_prerelease` (250+ lines away), which had no doc comment of its own. Moved it to the right place.\n\n## Scope\nDoc comments only. No behavior change anywhere -- confirmed via:\n- `cargo check --workspace --all-targets` clean\n- `callisto-graph`'s full test binary set compiles (`cargo test --no-run`)\n- `cascade::` unit tests (14) and `cascade_tests.rs` integration tests (7) pass, including both tests touched by the misattribution fix\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` clean\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Full workspace `cargo check --all-targets`\n- [x] Targeted test runs on every touched behavior-adjacent area (cascade)\n- [x] `cargo fmt` clean\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":788261,"output_tokens":631,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,