{"attachment":{"style":"","turnReminder":"","type":"output_style"},"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"fix-publish-order-dev-deps","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"a1773407-f6dd-4a5f-9d40-5edd835151b9","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey","timestamp":"2026-08-23T03:34:15.814Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"af114239-2e1c-4259-b4e2-68de8b071bf5","version":"2.1.238"}
{"parentUuid":"af114239-2e1c-4259-b4e2-68de8b071bf5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJygA3YGGNvkGgqy2Tds","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0113EDdmQRwVnH876fWaiCvk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nrefactor(graph): extract publish_order from the generic toposort trait\n\nDependencyResolverExt::toposort() was a generic-sounding method on a\nshared trait, but its edge-kind filter (Runtime/Build/Optional, no Dev)\nwas actually tuned for its one caller, plan_publish -- exactly the kind\nof leaky abstraction that let the dev-dependency publish-ordering bug\nland invisibly. Replaced it with publish_order(), a free function next\nto plan_publish with its rationale documented inline.\n\ntoposort_impl itself is now genuinely generic: it takes an explicit\nordering_kinds: &[DepKind] parameter instead of a hardcoded filter, so\nit no longer carries any one caller's assumptions. No behavior change --\npublish_order still passes the same Runtime/Build/Optional set today;\nthe actual dev-dependency ordering fix is a separate, follow-up change.\n\nVerified: cargo check --all-targets clean, including cascade_tests.rs's\ndirect toposort_impl usage (updated to pass the kind list explicitly).\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":810177,"output_tokens":446,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":323,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":446,"cache_read_input_tokens":810177,"cache_creation_input_tokens":323,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_inp