{"parentUuid":"3f6327da-a7af-464f-9fae-9d76431eb0df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeK3VL7gNViiYfwpBZrKe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RSfinGXNgeviwBUyYQ1eWP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfix(graph): account for dev-dependencies in publish ordering\n\ncargo publish (run without --no-verify) rebuilds the packaged tarball\nto verify it, needing every Cargo.toml dependency -- dev included --\nresolvable from the registry. publish_order previously only considered\nRuntime/Build/Optional edges (correct for cascade, wrong for publish),\nso a package with a dev-dependency on a same-batch sibling could be\nscheduled before that sibling -- exactly what broke the 0.4.0 release\n(callisto-conventional's dev-dependency on callisto-vcs, demoted from a\nreal dependency by the earlier CommitWalker decoupling).\n\npublish_order now tries Dev-inclusive ordering first, falling back to\nthe cascade-scoped kinds only if that would produce a cycle -- a\nlegitimate mutual dev-dependency between two otherwise-unrelated\npackages must not hard-fail the whole publish plan.\n\nVerified: a new test proves the fix fails without it (confirmed by\ntemporarily reverting to the old single-attempt call), a second proves\na dev-only cycle no longer hard-fails, and a third proves a genuine\nRuntime cycle still errors as before. Full callisto-graph suite (408\nunit tests) and clippy clean.\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":841514,"output_tokens":515,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":841514,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeK3VJCqQPvZErbwhGMNq","type":"assistant","uuid":"2061cb91-b278-4f78-b62f-65c50ed7f345","timestamp":"2026-08-23T04:24:22.951Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"fix-publish-order-dev-deps","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
