{"parentUuid":"2a6e2484-c92f-4ff5-93f0-c25fa7e4ffa2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeK6UnBu2AdZC8UCaPK1W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Push succeeded — the pre-push hook ran full clippy across all 10 crates cleanly this time (confirming it really was a transient stall, now resolved). Opening the PR."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4674,"cache_read_input_tokens":866022,"output_tokens":1106,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":210},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4674,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1106,"cache_read_input_tokens":866022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4674},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeK6Uip19vSPYJUW2VMeF","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b3a8e28-4aaa-4b87-89a7-c8ebdff65b70","timestamp":"2026-08-23T05:03:34.627Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"fix-publish-order-dev-deps","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"2b3a8e28-4aaa-4b87-89a7-c8ebdff65b70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeK6UnBu2AdZC8UCaPK1W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EBQWFqrt97QyUqiRBt3MSP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto\ngh pr create --title \"fix(graph): account for dev-dependencies in publish ordering\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\nFixes the bug that broke the 0.4.0 release: `publish_order` only considered `Runtime`/`Build`/`Optional` dependency edges (correct for cascade/version-bump propagation), never `Dev`. `cargo publish` (run without `--no-verify`) rebuilds the packaged tarball to verify it, which needs every `Cargo.toml` dependency -- dev included -- resolvable from the registry. A package with a dev-dependency on a same-batch sibling could therefore be scheduled to publish before that sibling.\n\nThis is exactly what happened with `callisto-conventional`'s dev-dependency on `callisto-vcs` (demoted from a real dependency by the earlier `CommitWalker` decoupling), causing four crates to get stuck at `0.3.3` while five successfully reached `0.4.0`.\n\n## Design\n- `publish_order` now tries `Dev`-inclusive ordering first.\n- If that would produce a cycle, it falls back to the cascade-scoped kinds (`Runtime`/`Build`/`Optional`) instead of hard-failing -- a legitimate mutual dev-dependency between two otherwise-unrelated packages (e.g. cross-integration tests) must not block the entire publish plan.\n- Builds on the earlier extraction commit (`publish_order` as its own purpose-named function, `toposort_impl` genuinely generic via an explicit `ordering_kinds` parameter) already on this branch.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] New test proves the fix: reverting to the old single-attempt call makes it fail with the exact wrong order (`[conventional, vcs]`); confirmed, then restored.\n- [x] New test proves a dev-only cycle no longer hard-fails.\n- [x] New test proves a genuine `Runtime` cycle still errors as before.\n- [x] Full `callisto-graph` unit suite (408 tests) passes.\n- [x] `cascade_tests.rs` integration tests (7) pass.\n- [x] `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n- [x] `cargo fmt --all -- --check` clean.\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4674,"cache_read_input_tokens":866022,"output_tokens":1106,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":210},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4674,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1106,"cache_read_input_tokens":866022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4674},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeK6Uip19vSPYJUW2VMeF","type":"assistant","uuid":"ee148ba9-c7c0-4619-aed4-0b4603d45e6d","timestamp":"2026-08-23T05:03:41.852Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"fix-publish-order-dev-deps","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
