{"parentUuid":"9c0325f0-558c-49c7-aa3f-dac287341940","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKtespNT6e8fBng7gr36","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_read_input_tokens":917861,"output_tokens":1752,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1158},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1152,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1752,"cache_read_input_tokens":917861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1152},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKtepjaeaRL1xwXjmWwT","type":"assistant","uuid":"5dd28da9-9ccf-4ad8-b510-a97fbb9ed397","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:09:16.957Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"5dd28da9-9ccf-4ad8-b510-a97fbb9ed397","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKtespNT6e8fBng7gr36","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found it, concretely: no child processes, only 3 threads, and none burning CPU — this is stuck in the **single-threaded metadata/query phase** (matches `--emit=dep-info,metadata`, before parallel codegen would even start), holding an **incremental-compilation session lock** (`s-hlm4y3hcyn-1ucsv82.lock`).\n\nMy best-supported explanation: this specific test target (`moon_wasm_sandbox`) has a huge, complex incremental query-dependency graph (wasmtime/extism/aws-lc-sys chain). Every time I `kill -9`'d a build today, any in-flight incremental state for whatever was compiling at that moment got left in a partial/inconsistent state. Small crates recover fine on the next build; this one's incremental graph is complex enough that a corrupted intermediate state can deadlock rustc's own internal query scheduler — a known class of issue with incremental compilation surviving ungraceful kills, and I've now killed builds touching this exact crate multiple times today.\n\nThe fix: wipe the incremental cache again (it's regrown since my last clear) and disable incremental compilation for this one push attempt (`CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0`) to sidestep the whole bug class rather than hope it doesn't recur."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_read_input_tokens":917861,"output_tokens":1752,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1158},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1152,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1752,"cache_read_input_tokens":917861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1152},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKtepjaeaRL1xwXjmWwT","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d314e6f-4284-4ed8-9303-b00db83832fb","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:09:21.317Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
