{"parentUuid":"2f4b2e52-8600-45a3-bc15-a77b915b8722","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKvN98NdNrLeXCzXw7bs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":89698,"output_tokens":981,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":203},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":981,"cache_read_input_tokens":89698,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKvN8J2LPDjtRhUrMcmp","type":"assistant","uuid":"46755a3e-5551-4f47-a6d1-9143247fe1e9","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:31:31.240Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"46755a3e-5551-4f47-a6d1-9143247fe1e9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKvN98NdNrLeXCzXw7bs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed: `just pre-push` = `fmt-check` + `lint`, and `just lint` runs `moon run :lint`, which unconditionally fans out `cargo clippy -p $project --all-targets` for all 10 crates on every single push — each one serialized behind Cargo's shared `target/` lock. That's the actual mechanism behind every stall this session (\"17 min for rustfmt\", the wasm-crate hang theory, all of it).\n\n**Two independent fixes, either helps, both is best:**\n\n1. **Scope pre-push to affected projects only** — moon supports `--affected` (or a git-diff-based project filter) so a push only lints crates whose files actually changed, instead of blindly running all 10 serialized `cargo clippy` invocations every time.\n2. **Collapse per-crate invocations into one `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`** — a single Cargo process gets to use its own internal parallel job scheduler across all crates at once, instead of N separate processes queuing behind each other's build-directory lock.\n\nWant me to implement (1), (2), or both in `.moon/tasks/rust.yml`/`justfile`?"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":89698,"output_tokens":981,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":203},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":981,"cache_read_input_tokens":89698,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKvN8J2LPDjtRhUrMcmp","type":"assistant","uuid":"90d1f114-bf41-4a6f-b575-d49b402fbb7f","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:31:35.613Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"90d1f114-bf41-4a6f-b575-d49b402fbb7f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKvN98NdNrLeXCzXw7bs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CYhD8vhm7ks7By1xb7eMUx","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"How should the pre-push lint stall be fixed?","header":"Lint fix scope","options":[{"label":"Both: affected-only + single invocation (Recommended)","description":"Scope moon's lint task to only affected projects on push, AND collapse the full/CI lint run into one workspace-wide `cargo clippy` invocation instead of N per-crate ones. Fixes both the common case (fast local pushes) and the worst case (full-workspace CI/push runs)."},{"label":"Affected-only only","description":"Change just the pre-push hook to lint only changed projects via moon's affected-detection. Minimal change, leaves full-workspace lint (e.g. CI, `just ci`) running the same N-serialized-process way it does today."},{"label":"Single invocation only","description":"Replace moon's per-project `cargo clippy -p $project` with one `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets` task. Every push still lints the whole workspace, but as one process instead of 10 serialized ones."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":89698,"output_tokens":981,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":203},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":981,"cache_read_input_tokens":89698,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011