{"parentUuid":"c8b0baf4-b5c7-4c32-bf82-cc459ee54264","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9758f585-c9d6-4324-ab86-d498c170734e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017KrPRQrYqR42jBoeUBEQax","type":"tool_result","content":"=== .moon dir ===\ntasks/callisto.yml\ntasks/rust.yml\ntoolchains.yml\nworkspace.yml=== workspace.yml ===\n# Configures all projects within the workspace to create a project graph.\n# Accepts a list of globs, a mapping of projects to relative file paths,\n# or both values.\nprojects: [\"crates/*\"]\n\n# Configures the version control system (VCS). Also known as\n# source code management (SCM).\nvcs:\n  defaultBranch: \"main\"\n  provider: \"github\"\n  hooks:\n    pre-commit:\n      - \"just pre-commit\"\n    pre-push:\n      - \"just pre-push\"\n\n=== root moon.yml (if any) ===\n=== toolchain.yml ===\n=== justfile lint/ci recipes ===\n13:test:\n14-    cargo nextest run --workspace || moon run :test\n15-    cargo test --doc\n16-\n17-# Run Clippy lints (warnings treated as errors) via moon\n18:lint:\n19-    moon run :lint\n20-\n21-# Check code formatting compliance via moon\n22:fmt-check:\n23-    moon run :format-check\n24-\n25-# Format code automatically via moon\n26-fmt:\n27-    moon run :format\n--\n86:ci: fmt-check lint test audit doc-check wasm-check coverage","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ead0d0b3-9037-487c-b2d1-6aec53efd73d","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:33:23.924Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== .moon dir ===\ntasks/callisto.yml\ntasks/rust.yml\ntoolchains.yml\nworkspace.yml=== workspace.yml ===\n# Configures all projects within the workspace to create a project graph.\n# Accepts a list of globs, a mapping of projects to relative file paths,\n# or both values.\nprojects: [\"crates/*\"]\n\n# Configures the version control system (VCS). Also known as\n# source code management (SCM).\nvcs:\n  defaultBranch: \"main\"\n  provider: \"github\"\n  hooks:\n    pre-commit:\n      - \"just pre-commit\"\n    pre-push:\n      - \"just pre-push\"\n\n=== root moon.yml (if any) ===\n=== toolchain.yml ===\n=== justfile lint/ci recipes ===\n13:test:\n14-    cargo nextest run --workspace || moon run :test\n15-    cargo test --doc\n16-\n17-# Run Clippy lints (warnings treated as errors) via moon\n18:lint:\n19-    moon run :lint\n20-\n21-# Check code formatting compliance via moon\n22:fmt-check:\n23-    moon run :format-check\n24-\n25-# Format code automatically via moon\n26-fmt:\n27-    moon run :format\n--\n86:ci: fmt-check lint test audit doc-check wasm-check coverage","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c8b0baf4-b5c7-4c32-bf82-cc459ee54264","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
