{"parentUuid":"fd0a6725-f439-44ed-ae32-dcf91b93de27","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKvbasYWDRo8VBN3LP4b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Root cause confirmed and fix applied while the test runs in the background:\n\n- **`justfile:lint`** now runs `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets` as one process instead of moon fanning out 10 separate per-crate `cargo clippy -p X` invocations that serialize behind Cargo's shared `target/` lock.\n- **`justfile:lint-affected`** (new) uses `moon run :lint --affected`, scoped to only projects changed since `main` — used by `pre-push`. Just verified it correctly no-ops instantly when nothing's changed.\n- **`pre-push`** now runs `fmt-check` + `lint-affected` instead of the full-workspace `lint`.\n\nWaiting on the single-invocation `just lint` timing to confirm the CI-path improvement before reporting final numbers."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":330,"cache_read_input_tokens":98963,"output_tokens":422,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":330,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":98963,"cache_creation_input_tokens":330,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":330},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKvba1T9YcYsxikitsUu","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3f61ab3-aaaa-4e4e-b1be-838e1c06848c","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:34:34.418Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gi