{"parentUuid":"e42b361f-304a-425b-bb16-de256ec66c2a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fc3a55ec-1780-48ea-b842-55f438ab4c0f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N48EGJW3zoupZjjxT8CRQt","type":"tool_result","content":"Manage toolchain plugins.\n\nUsage: moon toolchain [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  add       Add and configure a toolchain plugin.\n  download  Download all configured toolchain plugins.\n  info      Show detailed information about a toolchain plugin.\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n\nGlobal options:\n      --cache <CACHE>\n          Mode for cache operations\n          \n          [env: MOON_CACHE=]\n          [default: read-write]\n\n      --color\n          Force colored output\n          \n          [env: MOON_COLOR=]\n\n  -c, --concurrency <CONCURRENCY>\n          Maximum number of threads to utilize\n          \n          [env: MOON_CONCURRENCY=]\n\n      --dump\n          Dump a trace profile to the working directory\n          \n          [env: MOON_DUMP=]\n\n      --log <LOG>\n          Lowest log level to output\n\n          Possible values:\n          - off\n          - error\n          - warn\n          - info\n          - debug\n          - trace\n          - verbose: Like `Trace`, but also includes all modules and spans\n          \n          [env: MOON_LOG=]\n          [default: info]\n\n      --log-file <LOG_FILE>\n          Path to a file to write logs to\n          \n          [env: MOON_LOG_FILE=]\n\n  -q, --quiet\n          Hide all moon console output\n          \n          [env: MOON_QUIET=]\n\n      --theme <THEME>\n          Terminal theme to print with\n          \n          [env: MOON_THEME=]\n          [default: dark]\n          [possible values: dark, light]\n---\nRun all affected tasks in a CI environment.\n\nUsage: moon ci [OPTIONS] [TARGETS]...\n\nArguments:\n  [TARGETS]...\n          List of explicit task targets to run\n\nOptions:\n  -f, --force\n          Force run and bypass cache, ignore changed files, and skip affected checks\n          \n          [env: MOON_FORCE=]\n\n  -i, --interactive\n          Run the pipeline and tasks interactively\n\n  -p, --plan <PLAN>\n          Relative path to an execution plan (JSON) in which to customize the action graph and\n          pipeline\n          \n          [env: MOON_EXEC_PLAN=]\n\n  -s, --summary [<SUMMARY>]\n          Print a summary of all actions that were ran in the pipeline\n          \n          [env: MOON_SUMMARY=]\n          [possible values: none, minimal, normal, detailed]\n\n  -h, --help\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n\nAffected options:\n      --base <BASE>\n          Base branch, commit, or revision to compare against\n          \n          [env: MOON_BASE=]\n---check---\nRun build and test related tasks for one or many projects.\n\nUsage: moon check [OPTIONS] [IDS]...\n\nArguments:\n  [IDS]...\n          List of explicit project IDs to check\n\nOptions:\n      --all\n          Check all projects\n\n      --closest\n          Check the closest project\n\n  -f, --force\n          Force run and bypass cache, ignore changed files, and skip affected checks\n          \n          [env: MOON_FORCE=]\n\n  -i, --interactive\n          Run the pipeline and tasks interactively\n\n  -p, --plan <PLAN>\n          Relative path to an execution plan (JSON) in which to customize the action graph and\n          pipeline\n          \n          [env: MOON_EXEC_PLAN=]\n\n  -s, --summary [<SUMMARY>]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"231c8ba7-9cc8-45f4-ba3b-dc079fd7b670","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:43:23.650Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Manage toolchain plugins.\n\nUsage: moon toolchain [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  add       Add and configure a toolchain plugin.\n  download  Download all configured toolchain plugins.\n  info      Show detailed information about a toolchain plugin.\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n\nGlobal options:\n      --cache <CACHE>\n          Mode for cache operations\n          \n          [env: MOON_CACHE=]\n          [default: read-write]\n\n      --color\n          Force colored output\n          \n          [env: MOON_COLOR=]\n\n  -c, --concurrency <CONCURRENCY>\n          Maximum number of threads to utilize\n          \n          [env: MOON_CONCURRENCY=]\n\n      --dump\n          Dump a trace profile to the working directory\n          \n          [env: MOON_DUMP=]\n\n      --log <LOG>\n          Lowest log level to output\n\n          Possible values:\n          - off\n          - error\n          - warn\n          - info\n          - debug\n          - trace\n          - verbose: Like `Trace`, but also includes all modules and spans\n          \n          [env: MOON_LOG=]\n          [default: info]\n\n      --log-file <LOG_FILE>\n          Path to a file to write logs to\n          \n          [env: MOON_LOG_FILE=]\n\n  -q, --quiet\n          Hide all moon console output\n          \n          [env: MOON_QUIET=]\n\n      --theme <THEME>\n          Terminal theme to print with\n          \n          [env: MOON_THEME=]\n          [default: dark]\n          [possible values: dark, light]\n---\nRun all affected tasks in a CI environment.\n\nUsage: moon ci [OPTIONS] [TARGETS]...\n\nArguments:\n  [TARGETS]...\n          List of explicit task targets to run\n\nOptions:\n  -f, --force\n          Force run and bypass cache, ignore changed files, and skip affected checks\n          \n          [env: MOON_FORCE=]\n\n  -i, --interactive\n          Run the pipeline and tasks interactively\n\n  -p, --plan <PLAN>\n          Relative path to an execution plan (JSON) in which to customize the action graph and\n          pipeline\n          \n          [env: MOON_EXEC_PLAN=]\n\n  -s, --summary [<SUMMARY>]\n          Pr