{"parentUuid":"ea28728f-43f0-4470-afd5-46dc8823c6cb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fc3a55ec-1780-48ea-b842-55f438ab4c0f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018A55vaDgNq5aqiAfAox27j","type":"tool_result","content":"Toolchain ──────────────────────\n\n  ID: rust\n  Title: Rust\n  Version: 1.0.6\n\nConfiguration ──────────────────\n\n  addMsrvConstraint: bool\n  When `version` is defined, syncs the version as a constraint to\n  `Cargo.toml` under the `workspace.package.rust-version` or\n  `package.rust-version` fields.\n\n  bins: [string | BinConfig]\n  List of binaries to install into the environment using `cargo binstall`.\n\n  binstallVersion: string | null\n  The fully-qualified version of `cargo-binstall` to install.\n  Defaults to \"latest\" if not defined.\n\n  components: [string]\n  List of Rust components to automatically install with `rustup`.\n\n  syncToolchainConfig: bool\n  When `version` is defined, syncs the version to `rust-toolchain.toml`\n  under the `toolchain.channel` field.\n\n  targets: [string]\n  List of Rust targets to automatically install with `rustup`.\n\n  version: string | null\n  Configured version (channel) to download and install with `rustup`.\n\nTier 1 - Usage detection ───────\n\n  Config files: .cargo/*.toml, rust-toolchain, rust-toolchain.toml\n  Executable names: cargo, rustc, rustdoc, rustfmt, rustup\n\n  🟢 define_docker_metadata\n  🟢 define_toolchain_config\n  🟢 detect_version_files\n  ⚫️ extend_command\n  🟢 initialize_toolchain\n  🟢 parse_version_file\n  🟢 prune_docker\n  🟢 register_toolchain (required)\n  🟢 scaffold_docker\n  ⚫️ sync_project\n  ⚫️ sync_workspace\n\nTier 2 - Ecosystem integration ─\n\n  Manifest files: Cargo.toml\n  Lock files: Cargo.lock\n  Vendor directory: target\n\n  ⚫️ define_requirements\n  🟢 extend_project_graph\n  🟢 extend_task_command\n  🟢 extend_task_script","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"89234212-5a55-44f5-993e-db280145cbdd","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:44:02.882Z",