{"parentUuid":"6c8f08dd-88c0-4712-a5b7-3a1c12f3b9b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKwNvncu8bGjaBfNkpgR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This confirms the ideal approach: `moon query projects --affected` correctly identifies exactly which crates changed (verified live — touched 2 files, got exactly those 2 project IDs back). Combining that with a single scoped `cargo clippy -p X -p Y` invocation gives both affected-only scoping *and* Cargo's own internal parallelism, with zero lock contention. This matches moonrepo's own Rust handbook guidance, which explicitly documents the build-lock problem and recommends workspace-wide (not per-crate) cargo invocations.\n\nLet me upgrade `lint-affected` from the moon-fan-out version to this properly scoped single-invocation version."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":500,"cache_read_input_tokens":171394,"output_tokens":1399,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1068},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":500,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1399,"cache_read_input_tokens":171394,"cache_creation_input_tokens":500,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":500},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKwNuRkpk2dCuCG2Fi2M","type":"assistant","uuid":"dc14c4f8-cd5f-4ba8-bd09-307c02443a4c","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:45:00.730Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
