{"parentUuid":"95fe085b-bc04-428f-8756-ffabca956a1a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKwaqpYw94HeinoeVreu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SyGUvoWThwFePNVBRj6XuB","name":"ScheduleWakeup","input":{"delaySeconds":600,"noop":true,"prompt":"Check background task bsunwhxil (`time just ci`, log at /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118/scratchpad/ci-full.log) — it should complete via its own task-notification before this fires; this is a long fallback only. Once it's done (check log for final timing line and pass/fail), report to the user. Then re-test the upgraded `just lint-affected` recipe (justfile) now that ci's lock is released: `echo \"\" >> crates/callisto-model/src/lib.rs; echo \"\" >> crates/callisto-vcs/src/lib.rs; just lint-affected` should print exactly `cargo clippy -p callisto-model -p callisto-vcs --all-targets -- -D warnings` behavior and pass; then `git checkout -- crates/callisto-model/src/lib.rs crates/callisto-vcs/src/lib.rs` to revert the test edit and confirm `git status --short` shows only `justfile` modified. Also re-verify the zero-affected case (`just lint-affected` on clean tree) still no-ops instantly. Then summarize the full research findings and fix to the user: moonrepo's own Rust handbook documents the Cargo build-lock serialization problem and recommends workspace-wide cargo invocations over per-crate ones (confirms our fix); moon's project graph has real Cargo-workspace awareness via `moon query projects --affected`, which correctly identifies changed crates and can be combined with a single `-p`-flagged cargo invocation for the best of both worlds (scoping + parallelism) — this is what lint-affected now does. Ask whether to commit the justfile changes (lint/lint-affected/pre-push split) once everything is verified.","reason":"Waiting for cargo nextest test suite to finish and release the target-dir lock before re-testing lint-affected.\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":371,"cache_read_input_tokens":176186,"output_tokens":813,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":371,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":813,"cache_read_input_tokens":176186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":371},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKwapTTBtmov3uGuD78e","type":"assistant","uuid":"24388362-c7ce-406d-9f4f-802e7022db45","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:47:37.015Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
