{"attachment":{"style":"","turnReminder":"","type":"output_style"},"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"008689be-e61e-4c7f-a780-21f4f5608907","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:47:38.901Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"46cb29bf-aef3-4f6b-82b7-21d088e52eac","version":"2.1.238"}
{"parentUuid":"46cb29bf-aef3-4f6b-82b7-21d088e52eac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKwbmhn1YaLR3t2AED4L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Research findings so far, confirmed against moonrepo's own docs:**\n\n- Moon's Rust toolchain has zero target-directory or build-lock coordination logic (checked `moon toolchain info rust` — only version/binstall/component config, nothing about `target/`). It treats `cargo` as an opaque command.\n- Moonrepo's own [Rust handbook](https://moonrepo.dev/docs/guides/rust/handbook) explicitly documents this exact problem: *\"if you do per-crate, Cargo itself will 'wait for build lock' when multiple processes are running\"* — and recommends workspace-wide invocations (`cargo test --workspace`, `cargo clippy --workspace`) instead, which is exactly the fix already shipped.\n- What moon *does* have real value for: its project graph parses `Cargo.toml`/`Cargo.lock` for genuine dependency-graph awareness, and `moon query projects --affected` correctly reports exactly which crates changed (verified live against two touched files). That's real signal moon computes that plain Cargo can't.\n\nSo the best pattern is neither \"moon per-crate\" nor \"always full-workspace\" — it's moon for *detecting* what changed, Cargo for *executing* it as one process. I've upgraded `lint-affected` to do exactly that (query moon → single `cargo clippy -p X -p Y ...`), giving both scoping and Cargo's own internal parallel job scheduler with zero lock contention. Waiting for the background `just ci` run to release the build lock so I can finish verifying it, then I'll report full results."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":974,"cache_read_input_tokens":176557,"output_tokens":523,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":974,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":523,"cache_read_input_tokens":176557,"cache_creation_input_tokens":974,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":974},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKwbjYJexpfCUG7Fo6sU","type":"assistant","uuid":"bbafe65c-1f35-4bba-90d2-a16a5ebe2fe4","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:47:46.527Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
