{"parentUuid":"b454c23e-8961-400c-bdae-671cb7c9333b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKwgVhkMiYNbNdFcTiTw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":120,"cache_read_input_tokens":178054,"output_tokens":1251,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":785},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":120,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1251,"cache_read_input_tokens":178054,"cache_creation_input_tokens":120,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":120},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKwgUdFpJ5P9hd2Mog4N","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa6e02e1-592a-4d61-84df-85d945998078","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:48:53.988Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"aa6e02e1-592a-4d61-84df-85d945998078","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKwgVhkMiYNbNdFcTiTw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No — I didn't remove moon's `--affected` detection; I replaced how the affected list gets *executed*, not how it gets *computed*. Two different things were both called \"lint-affected\":\n\n1. **`moon query projects --affected`** — moon's actual affected-detection (parses the Cargo dependency graph, figures out which crates changed). This is still there, unchanged, and is the part I verified works (correctly returned exactly `callisto-model`/`callisto-vcs` when I touched those two files).\n\n2. **`moon run :lint --affected`** — my first draft, which took that same affected list and ran it through moon's per-project task system, meaning one separate `cargo clippy -p X` process per affected crate. What I confirmed \"works\" for this was only the **zero-affected case** (clean tree → instant no-op) — I never actually tested it with 2+ affected projects running concurrently, because by then I already knew from the root-cause finding that 2+ separate `cargo` processes on the same `target/` dir hit the exact same build-lock serialization as the original bug, just at a smaller scale.\n\nSo I swapped step 2: keep moon's affected list, but feed it into **one** `cargo clippy -p A -p B --all-targets` call instead of moon spawning N processes. Same detection, single execution — that's the part I'm mid-verification on right now (blocked briefly by the background `just ci` holding the same lock, should be clear shortly)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":120,"cache_read_input_tokens":178054,"output_tokens":1251,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":785},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":120,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1251,"cache_read_input_tokens":178054,"cache_creation_input_tokens":120,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":120},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKwgUdFpJ5P9hd2Mog4N","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca58fc69-050a-45c6-ae77-32dd9447b4c0","timestamp":"2026-08-23T15:48:59.381Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
