{"parentUuid":"c19e512c-cd0f-45ab-a3a0-1a6c7fa5616d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKxqRqT2ACe7Ha7qH9Ar","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3825,"cache_read_input_tokens":203610,"output_tokens":3332,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2927},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3825,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3332,"cache_read_input_tokens":203610,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3825},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKxqQqRbVSLb4d6bzJXv","type":"assistant","uuid":"3dd9fc4b-2e05-423a-964b-71a6350229fe","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:04:26.497Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"3dd9fc4b-2e05-423a-964b-71a6350229fe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKxqRqT2ACe7Ha7qH9Ar","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two real options here — ranked by what I'd actually recommend:\n\n**Option A (recommended): accept it, don't add infrastructure for it.** Cargo's own incremental engine already gives a near-zero-cost no-op re-check — we measured `cargo clippy --workspace` finish in **1.00s** on a fully warm, unchanged tree. Moon's task-level caching would only shave off that residual ~1s locally. And this repo doesn't use moon's remote/CI cache backend at all (only `Swatinem/rust-cache` for Cargo's own registry/target caching) — so there's no cross-machine caching value being lost, only a same-machine ~1s. Building more moon config to recover ~1s isn't worth the maintenance surface.\n\n**Option B: restore moon-level caching properly, if you actually want it.** This is possible and I want to verify it's real before recommending it outright — let me test."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3825,"cache_read_input_tokens":203610,"output_tokens":3332,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2927},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3825,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3332,"cache_read_input_tokens":203610,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3825},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKxqQqRbVSLb4d6bzJXv","type":"assistant","uuid":"bcfa6b61-5bff-4d10-9571-cf548e106a7e","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:04:29.221Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"extern