{"parentUuid":"21b6ffbe-84a1-4abe-a8ca-8bf194fe1721","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKxuZ4tMAQKggpn5NsBf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HqnivFqAEzUkcZekHBwugx","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/config/workspace#projects","prompt":"What is the exact YAML syntax for the `projects` field in workspace.yml when combining explicit project-id-to-path mappings with glob patterns? Show the exact structure (e.g. does it use a `globs` key and a separate map, or something else) for having both a literal root-level project and a glob like crates/* in the same workspace.yml."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":211608,"output_tokens":255,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":54},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":701,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":211608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":701,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":701},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKxuXyQWj2f68N4xwKz3","type":"assistant","uuid":"3cc6180c-53a5-4563-bc13-330b9abbb6b5","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:04:51.095Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"3cc6180c-53a5-4563-bc13-330b9abbb6b5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"02ca3eea-f20a-43b6-9b16-996a48ee0400","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HqnivFqAEzUkcZekHBwugx","type":"tool_result","content":"# YAML Syntax for Mixed Projects Configuration\n\nBased on the documentation, when combining explicit project mappings with glob patterns, use this structure:\n\n```yaml\nprojects:\n  globs:\n    - 'crates/*'\n  sources:\n    www: 'www'\n```\n\nThe documentation states: \"The list of globs can be defined under a `globs` field, while the map of projects under a `sources` field.\"\n\n**Key points:**\n- `globs` array contains pattern-based project discovery\n- `sources` object contains explicit project-id-to-path mappings\n- Both can coexist in the same `projects` configuration\n- Project names from glob patterns are derived from folder names but can be customized via the `id` setting in individual `moon.*` files\n\nOptionally, you can also customize glob-discovered project IDs using `globFormat`:\n\n```yaml\nprojects:\n  globFormat: 'source-path'\n  globs:\n    - 'packages/**/moon.yml'\n  sources:\n    www: 'www'\n```"}]},"uuid":"4a926550-c0df-4cf9-8bfb-a8115d27e052","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:04:56.903Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":169326,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# YAML Syntax for Mixed Projects Configuration\n\nBased on the documentation, when combining explicit project mappings with glob patterns, use this structure:\n\n```yaml\nprojects:\n  globs:\n    - 'crates/*'\n  sources:\n    www: 'www'\n```\n\nThe documentation states: \"The list of globs can be defined under a `globs` field, while the map of projects under a `sources` field.\"\n\n**Key points:**\n- `globs` array contains pattern-based project discovery\n- `sources` object contains explicit project-id-to-path mappings\n- Both can coexist in the same `projects` configuration\n- Project names from glob patterns are derived from folder names but can be customized via the `id` setting in individual `moon.*` files\n\nOptionally, you can also customize glob-discovered project IDs using `globFormat`:\n\n```yaml\nprojects:\n  globFormat: 'source-path'\n  globs:\n    - 'packages/**/moon.yml'\n  sources:\n    www: 'www'\n```","durationMs":4028,"url":"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/config/workspace#projects"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3cc6180c-53a5-4563-bc13-330b9abbb6b5","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
