{"parentUuid":"2d48a2c3-2539-4162-a221-8a1f5cf2f22a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKyJPmBbfSzEtxohETYi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things happened: (1) my root-project registration is genuinely broken — `moon run :test` now tries `cargo test -p root`, which doesn't exist as a package, since the root pseudo-project inherits *all* global rust tasks by default; (2) a real test failure surfaced (`callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox::register_extension_matches_moon_wire_protocol`), separate issue, need to check if it's flaky or real. Fixing the root-project inheritance bug first since it's actively breaking things."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2010,"cache_read_input_tokens":220209,"output_tokens":1579,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1215},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2010,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1579,"cache_read_input_tokens":220209,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2010,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2010},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKyJMB9zJGeeSPWDAxpZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"9e7b7c9d-39ae-4072-b6ac-61387bf80420","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:10:14.886Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"9e7b7c9d-39ae-4072-b6ac-61387bf80420","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKyJPmBbfSzEtxohETYi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011rPQVyM1hAekwQ2sfK7ocq","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/config/project#workspace","prompt":"How does a project's moon.yml exclude or opt out of globally inherited tasks (the workspace-level tasks defined in .moon/tasks/*.yml that normally apply to every project)? Show the exact YAML field/syntax for excluding specific inherited task names, or disabling all task inheritance for one project."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2010,"cache_read_input_tokens":220209,"output_tokens":1579,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1215},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2010,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1579,"cache_read_input_tokens":220209,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2010,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2010},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKyJMB9zJGeeSPWDAxpZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"664ba2bb-0aab-4bb1-84f0-3ded5e3cb60c","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:10:16.303Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
{"parentUuid":"664ba2bb-0aab-4bb1-84f0-3ded5e3cb60c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8c164ebf-cc17-4afc-ba3d-aef1dc98fd61","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011rPQVyM1hAekwQ2sfK7ocq","type":"tool_result","content":"# Excluding Inherited Tasks in moon.yml\n\nTo opt out of globally inherited tasks, use the `workspace.inheritedTasks` section in a project's `moon.yml`:\n\n## Exclude Specific Tasks\n\n```yaml\nworkspace:\n  inheritedTasks:\n    exclude: ['test', 'lint']\n```\n\nThe documentation states: \"The optional `exclude` setting permits a project to exclude specific tasks from being inherited. It accepts a list of strings, where each string is the name of a global task to exclude.\"\n\n## Disable All Task Inheritance\n\nTo inherit no tasks at all, use an empty `include` list:\n\n```yaml\nworkspace:\n  inheritedTasks:\n    include: []\n```\n\nAccording to the docs: \"When this field is not defined, the project will inherit all tasks from the global project config,\" but an empty list effectively creates a full opt-out.\n\n## Processing Order\n\nImportant: \"Exclusion is applied after inclusion and before renaming,\" so if you define both `include` and `exclude`, inclusion happens first, then exclusion filters the result."}]},"uuid":"4bcdef12-e544-453c-95a6-2d4e0e3bfe26","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:10:22.202Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":328647,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Excluding Inherited Tasks in moon.yml\n\nTo opt out of globally inherited tasks, use the `workspace.inheritedTasks` section in a project's `moon.yml`:\n\n## Exclude Specific Tasks\n\n```yaml\nworkspace:\n  inheritedTasks:\n    exclude: ['test', 'lint']\n```\n\nThe documentation states: \"The optional `exclude` setting permits a project to exclude specific tasks from being inherited. It accepts a list of strings, where each string is the name of a global task to exclude.\"\n\n## Disable All Task Inheritance\n\nTo inherit no tasks at all, use an empty `include` list:\n\n```yaml\nworkspace:\n  inheritedTasks:\n    include: []\n```\n\nAccording to the docs: \"When this field is not defined, the project will inherit all tasks from the global project config,\" but an empty list effectively creates a full opt-out.\n\n## Processing Order\n\nImportant: \"Exclusion is applied after inclusion and before renaming,\" so if you define both `include` and `exclude`, inclusion happens first, then exclusion filters the result.","durationMs":4065,"url":"https://moonrepo.dev/docs/config/project#workspace"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"664ba2bb-0aab-4bb1-84f0-3ded5e3cb60c","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
