{"parentUuid":"b5bb1885-28c0-4b7b-8587-75313d391cd2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeKyWUMqndJ6cCUscnxFF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EyfLde12v9DE54qWwAPUmu","name":"ScheduleWakeup","input":{"delaySeconds":300,"noop":true,"prompt":"Check background task belfx2fxb (rerun of the single failing test `callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox::register_extension_matches_moon_wire_protocol` in isolation, output at /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/c0ad64b2-6440-4937-8328-8d9fd9db278c/tasks/belfx2fxb.output). Should complete via its own task-notification before this fires.\n\nContext: the earlier full `just ci` run (29m48s total, reported separately) had 1054/1055 tests pass with exactly this one test failing: `callisto-moon::moon_wasm_sandbox register_extension_matches_moon_wire_protocol`, error `test result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed`. That test failure ALSO triggered `just test`'s `cargo nextest run --workspace || moon run :test` fallback, which then hit a separate real bug: the new `root` moon project (added while prototyping Option B — moon-level caching for the workspace-wide lint task) inherited moon's global `test` task and moon tried `cargo test -p root`, which doesn't exist as a package, hard-failing `just ci` entirely. That inheritance bug has just been fixed: `moon.yml` at repo root now has `workspace: {inheritedTasks: {include: []}}`, and `moon query tasks` confirms the `root` project now has only the explicit `lint-workspace` task, no inherited build/test/lint/etc.\n\nOnce belfx2fxb completes: determine whether `register_extension_matches_moon_wire_protocol` is a real regression or flaky/pre-existing (check the actual assertion failure message/output, and consider whether it depends on shared global WasmHost state per the existing nextest.toml comment about wasm sandbox tests needing serial execution — test-groups moon-sandbox already forces max-threads=1 for `binary(moon_wasm_sandbox)`, so if this test failed even running alone it's likely a real bug worth investigating further, not a concurrency flake).\n\nThen verify the root-project inheritance fix is solid: run `moon run :test` and `moon run :lint` directly (the exact commands that broke) and confirm they no longer error on `root:test`/`root:lint` — they should just skip/not include root at all now since it opted out of inheritance, and only run the normal 10 crates.\n\nReport to the user: (1) whether the wasm sandbox test failure is real and needs a fix, or was a flake; (2) confirmation the root-project moon.yml inheritance bug is fixed; (3) full status of the Option B prototype (does `moon run root:lint-workspace` show a `(cached, ...)` marker on a second run, proving moon-level caching works for the workspace-wide lint command) with a final recommendation on whether to adopt it; (4) ask whether to commit the justfile + moon.yml + workspace.yml changes now that everything is verified, or whether to first also fix the wasm sandbox test if it's real.","reason":"Waiting on isolated test rerun (heavy wasmtime/aws-lc-sys build) to determine if the failure is real or flaky.\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":525,"cache_read_input_tokens":225375,"output_tokens":1225,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":525,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1225,"cache_read_input_tokens":225375,"cache_creation_input_tokens":525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":525},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeKyWSrJdPj7mmiRWpnNq","type":"assistant","uuid":"1ed7e207-f28