{"parentUuid":"9f937b71-a85e-4b29-86dd-2f235da19476","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeL2XAzhCctjFbDLhgRij","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Full checkpoint\n\n**1. Stale-wasm test bug — root cause confirmed, test now passes.**\n`register_extension_matches_moon_wire_protocol` failed because `resolve_wasm_file()` (`crates/callisto-moon/tests/moon_wasm_sandbox.rs:35-44`) reused a `.wasm` artifact built Aug 17 — before this session's version bump to `0.4.0` — since its only freshness check is `exists() && len() > 100`, never version/content. Deleting the stale artifact and letting it rebuild fixed it: `test result: ok`. That's the immediate fix. The **durable fix is still open**: that same check will silently reuse a stale artifact again on the next version bump, on any machine that already has a `target/wasm32-wasip1/` from before. Want me to fix `resolve_wasm_file()` properly now (e.g. compare the artifact's baked-in version against `CARGO_PKG_VERSION` and rebuild on mismatch), or track it as a follow-up?\n\n**2. justfile lint fix — verified, ready to commit.**\n`lint`/`lint-affected`/`pre-push` split, measured ~63min serialized moon fan-out → 5m13s single-invocation. Solid.\n\n**3. Option B (moon-level caching prototype) — never cleanly verified.**\n`.moon/workspace.yml` + new root `moon.yml` register a `root` pseudo-project with a `lint-workspace` task. Every attempt to confirm a `(cached, ...)` hit on a second run got tangled up in the wasm investigation instead. Given the blocker's now cleared, I can verify this in ~2 commands, or you can just drop it — recall the actual benefit is marginal (~1s, since Cargo's own incremental engine already no-ops near-instantly, and this repo has no moon remote-cache backend to make the win bigger).\n\n**4. Uncommitted right now:** `justfile`, `.moon/workspace.yml` (modified), `moon.yml` (new, untracked).\n\nWhat do you want to do — quickly finish verifying Option B, drop it, and/or take the durable wasm-staleness fix now?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":419,"cache_read_input_tokens":272467,"output_tokens":722,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":419,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":722,"cache_read_input_tokens":272467,"cache_creation_input_tokens":419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":419},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeL2X9as1ZdAEpUw5yajf","type":"assistant","uuid":"73ef636f-b125-4d86-a608-21dca499daa6","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:52:20.076Z","effort":"high","session_id":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","version":"2.1.238","gitBranch":"docs-cleanup-rust-comments","slug":"shimmying-giggling-hickey"}
