{"parentUuid":"4a68112f-7942-40fc-87a6-328f1aa173e5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"08b4d9cc-8e51-4671-b030-d7d3751c094c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017LAcJ9fuC95UW67c2RJUYp","type":"tool_result","content":"3:## Completed\n5:### Track B: Idempotent `apply_version_plan` — DONE\n11:### Track E: PackageId Specificity + Cross-Ecosystem Diagnostic — DONE\n20:### Track F: resolve_package_config Extraction — DONE\n27:### Track G: callisto matrix (napi + maturin auto-discovery) — DONE\n35:### Track: Manifest trait mutate/persist split (SPEC-MANIFEST-PERSIST-001, \"Spec A\") — DONE\n58:### Track: apply_version_plan write-batching (SPEC-APPLY-BATCH-002, \"Spec B\") — DONE\n108:### Track 3a/3b1: Workspace-Membership Filtering + Identity-Promotion Core — DONE\n117:### Track 3a: `match` Semantics Decision + Doc Correction — DONE\n122:### Track 6-doc / 8-doc: Stale Spec Claims (I/O boundary, Python ecosystem status) — DONE\n127:### Track 1: Fixed-Group Cascade Correctness — DONE\n142:### Track 2: Platform-Manifest / optionalDependencies Writes — DONE\n155:### Track 9: Cascade Correctness — Peer-Escalation & Cross-Ecosystem Rewrite Keys — DONE\n169:### Track 4: Release-Pipeline / CI Action Contract Correctness — DONE\n178:### Track 6-mechanical: JSON Report Field-Shape Alignment — DONE\n189:### Track 5: Changelog/PR-Body Rendering Consolidation — DONE\n201:## Pipeline Protocol (follow for every track, in order)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"25b1c67c-0570-44d5-afec-88982e35d652","timestamp":"2026-08-23T21:02:34.744Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"3:## Completed\n5:### Track B: Idempotent `apply_version_plan` — DONE\n11:### Track E: PackageId Specificity + Cross-Ecosystem Diagnostic — DONE\n20:### Track F: resolve_package_config Extraction — DONE\n27:### Track G: callisto matrix (napi + maturin auto-discovery) — DONE\n35:### Track: Manifest trait mutate/persist split (SPEC-MANIFEST-PERSIST-001, \"Spec A\") — DONE\n58:### Track: apply_version